<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">- Biblica® Open New Oromo Contemporary Version 2022</book>
  <para style="h">Iyyoob</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitaaba Iyyoob</para>
  <para style="toc2">Iyyoob</para>
  <para style="toc3">Iyo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitaaba</para>
  <para style="mt1">Iyyoob</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Seensa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1"/>Biyya Uuzi jedhamu keessa nama Iyyoob jedhamu tokkotu ture. Namichi kunis nama hirʼina hin qabnee fi qajeelaa, nama Waaqa sodaatuu fi hammina irraa fagaate ture. <verse eid="JOB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2"/>Innis ilmaan torbaa fi intallan sadii qaba ture; <verse eid="JOB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3"/>akkasumas hoolota kuma torba, gaala kuma sadii, qotiyyoo cimdii dhibba shanii fi harroota dhibba shan, tajaajiltoota hedduus qaba ture; innis namoota biyya Baʼa Biiftuu jiraatan hunda keessaa nama guddaa ture.<verse eid="JOB 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4"/>Ilmaan isaas mana isaaniitti dabaree dabareedhaan cidha qopheessanii akka isaan wajjin nyaatanii dhuganiif obboleettota isaanii sadan affeeru ture. <verse eid="JOB 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5"/>Erga yeroon cidha sanaa raawwatamee booddee Iyyoob itti ergee ijoollee isaa waamsisuudhaan, “Tarii ijoolleen koo cubbuu hojjetanii garaa isaaniittis Waaqa abaaraniiru taʼa” jedhee ganama barii waaʼee tokkoo tokkoo isaaniitiif aarsaa gubamu dhiʼeessuudhaan isaan qulqulleessa ture. Iyyoob yeroo hunda waan kana godha ture.<verse eid="JOB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Qorumsa Iyyoob Kan Jalqabaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6"/>Gaaf tokko yeroo ergamoonni Waaqayyoo fuula <char style="nd">Waaqayyoo</char> duratti dhiʼaachuuf dhufanitti Seexannis isaan wajjin dhufe. <verse eid="JOB 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7"/><char style="nd">Waaqayyos</char> seexanaan, “Ati Eessaa dhufte?” jedhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 1:7">Seexannis, “Ani lafa hunda irra jooraa, asii fi achis deddeebiʼaa tureen dhufe” jedhee <char style="nd">Waaqayyoof</char> deebise.<verse eid="JOB 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8"/>
    <char style="nd">Waaqayyos</char> Seexanaan, “Ati tajaajilaa koo Iyyoobin qalbeeffatteertaa? Namni isa fakkaatu tokko illee lafa irra hin jiru; inni nama hirʼina hin qabnee fi qajeelaa, nama Waaqa sodaatuu fi hammina irraa fagaatee dha” jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9"/>Seexanni immoo deebisee akkana jedhe, “Iyyoob akkasumaan Waaqa sodaataa? <verse eid="JOB 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10"/>Ati naannoo isaatti, warra mana isaa jiraatanii fi waan kan isaa taʼe hundatti dallaa ijaarteerta mitii? Ati akka bushaayee fi loon isaa biyyicha guutaniif hojii harka isaa eebbifteertaaf. <verse eid="JOB 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11"/>Garuu ati mee harka kee diriirsiitii waan inni qabu hunda dhaʼi; inni dhugumaan ifaan ifatti si abaara.”<verse eid="JOB 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12"/>
    <char style="nd">Waaqayyos</char> Seexanaan, “Kunoo, wanti inni qabu hundi si harka jira; isa garuu qubaanuu hin tuqin” jedhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 1:12">Sana booddee Seexanni fuula <char style="nd">Waaqayyoo</char> duraa baʼee deeme.<verse eid="JOB 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13"/>Gaaf tokko utuu ilmaanii fi intallan Iyyoob mana obboleessa isaanii isa hangafaatti nyaachaa, daadhii wayinii dhugaa jiranuu, <verse eid="JOB 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14"/>ergamaan tokko gara Iyyoob dhufee akkana jedhe; “Utuu qotiyyoon qotaa, harroonni immoo naannuma sana dheedaa jiranuu, <verse eid="JOB 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15"/>namoonni Shebaa balaa buusanii isaan fudhatanii deeman. Tajaajiltootas goraadeedhaan fixan; ana qofatu miliqee sitti himuuf dhufe!”<verse eid="JOB 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16"/>Utuma inni dubbachaa jiruu ergamaan biraa dhufee, “Ibiddi Waaqaa samiidhaa buʼee hoolotaa fi tajaajiltoota gubee fixe; ana qofatu miliqee sitti himuuf dhufe!” jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17"/>Utuu inni dubbachaa jiruu ammas ergamaan biraa dhufee, “Kaldoonni garee sadiitti qoodamanii gaalawwan kee irra yaaʼanii isaan oofatanii deeman; tajaajiltootas goraadeedhaan fixan; ana qofatu miliqee sitti himuuf dhufe!” jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18"/>Utuma inni dubbachaa jiruu ergamaan biraa dhufee akkana jedheen; “Ilmaanii fi intallan kee mana obboleessa isaanii isa hangafaatti nyaachaa, daadhii wayinii dhugaa turan; <verse eid="JOB 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19"/>yeroo kanattis bubbee hamaan akka tasaa gammoojjiidhaa kaʼee golee mana sanaa afran dhaʼe; manni sunis isaan irratti jigee dhuman; ana qofatu miliqee sitti himuuf dhufe!”<verse eid="JOB 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20"/>Kana irratti Iyyoob uffata isaa tarsaasee mataa isaa haaddate. Lafatti gombifamee sagadee <verse eid="JOB 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21"/>akkana jedhe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 1:21">“Ani qullaa koon gadameessa haadha kootiitii baʼe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 1:21">qullaa koos nan deema.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 1:21">
    <char style="nd">Waaqayyotu</char> kenne; <char style="nd">Waaqayyotu</char> fudhate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 1:21">maqaan <char style="nd">Waaqayyoo</char> haa eebbifamu.”<verse eid="JOB 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22"/>Wantoota kanneen hunda keessatti Iyyoob hojii dogoggoraatiin Waaqa himachuudhaan cubbuu hin hojjenne.<verse eid="JOB 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Qorumsa Iyyoob Isa Lammaffaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1"/>Guyyaa biraas ergamoonni Waaqayyoo fuula <char style="nd">Waaqayyoo</char> duratti dhiʼaachuuf dhufan; Seexannis isaan wajjin fuula <char style="nd">Waaqayyoo</char> duratti dhiʼaachuuf dhufe. <verse eid="JOB 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2"/><char style="nd">Waaqayyos</char> Seexanaan, “Ati eessaa dhufte?” jedhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 2:2">Seexannis, “Ani lafa hunda irra jooree asii fi achis deddeebiʼaa tureen dhufe” jedhee <char style="nd">Waaqayyoof</char> deebise.<verse eid="JOB 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3"/>
    <char style="nd">Waaqayyos</char> Seexanaan akkana jedhe; “Tajaajilaa koo Iyyoobin qalbeeffatteertaa? Namni isa fakkaatu tokko illee lafa irra hin jiru; inni nama hirʼina hin qabnee fi qajeelaa, nama Waaqa sodaatuu fi hammina irraa fagaate dha. Ati akka ani sababii tokko malee isa balleessuuf na kakaaftu iyyuu inni hamma ammaatti qajeelummaa isaa cichee qabateera.”<verse eid="JOB 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4"/>Seexannis deebisee akkana jedhe; “Gogaan gogaadhaaf! Namni lubbuu isaa oolfachuuf jedhee waan qabu hunda ni kenna. <verse eid="JOB 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5"/>Garuu ati mee harka kee diriirfadhuutii foonii fi lafee isaa rukuti; inni dhugumaan ifumaan ifatti si abaara.”<verse eid="JOB 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6"/>
    <char style="nd">Waaqayyos</char> Seexanaan, “Kunoo inni si harka jira; lubbuu isaa garuu hin tuqin” jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7"/>Kanaafuu Seexanni fuula <char style="nd">Waaqayyoo</char> duraa baʼee Iyyoobin faana miilla isaatii jalqabee hamma gubbee mataa isaatti madaa hamaadhaan rukute. <verse eid="JOB 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8"/>Iyyoobis ittiin of hooquuf jedhee qiraacii fudhatee daaraa keessa taaʼe.<verse eid="JOB 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9"/>Niitiin isaa, “Ati amma illee qajeelummaa kee cichitee qabatteertaa? Waaqa abaariitii duʼi!” isaan jette.<verse eid="JOB 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10"/>Inni immoo deebisee, “Ati akka dubartii gowwaa tokkootti dubbatte. Nu harka Waaqaatii waan gaarii fudhanneerra; waan hamaa immoo fudhachuu hin qabnuu?” jedhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 2:10">Wantoota kanneen hunda keessatti Iyyoob waan dubbateen cubbuu hin hojjenne.<verse eid="JOB 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Michoota Iyyoob Sadan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11"/>Michoonni Iyyoob sadan jechuunis Eliifaaz namni Teemaan, Bildaad namni Shuhaatii fi Zoofaari namni Naaʼimaataa yommuu waan Iyyoob irra gaʼe hunda dhagaʼanitti rakkina isaa qoodachuu fi isa jajjabeessuudhaaf tokkummaan walii galanii mana isaaniitii baʼan. <verse eid="JOB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12"/>Yommuu fagootti isa arganitti isa beekuu hin dandeenye; isaanis sagalee ol fudhatanii booʼan; uffata isaaniis tarsaasanii mataa isaaniitti daaraa firfirfatan. <verse eid="JOB 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13"/>Ergasiis guyyaa torbaa fi halkan torba isa wajjin lafa tataaʼan. Isaan sababii dhiphinni isaa akka malee cimaa taʼuu isaa arganiif, namni tokko iyyuu homaa isatti hin dubbanne.<verse eid="JOB 2:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Dubbii Iyyoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1"/>Kana irratti Iyyoob afaan isaa banatee guyyaa itti dhalate abaare. <verse eid="JOB 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 3:2"/>Innis akkana jedhe:<verse eid="JOB 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoob</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:3"/>“Guyyaan ani itti dhaladhe haa badu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:3">halkan, ‘Ilmi dhalate!’ jedhame sunis haa badu.<verse eid="JOB 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4"/>Guyyaan sun haa dukkanaaʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:4">Waaqni ol gubbaadhaa isa hin ilaalin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:4">ifnis itti hin ifin.<verse eid="JOB 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5"/>Dukkannii fi gaaddidduun guddaan isa haa dhaalan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">duumessi isa irra haa buʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">ifa isaa dukkanni haa liqimsu.<verse eid="JOB 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6"/>Halkan sana dukkanni limixiin haa qabatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">guyyoota waggaa keessa jiranittis hin dabalamin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">yookaan jiʼoota kam iyyuu keessatti hin lakkaaʼamin.<verse eid="JOB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7"/>Halkan sun haa maseenu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:7">ililleenis keessatti hin dhagaʼamin.<verse eid="JOB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8"/>Warri Lewaataanin kakaasuuf qophaaʼan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:8">kanneen guyyoota abaaran guyyaa sana haa abaaran.<verse eid="JOB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9"/>Bakkalchi barii kan guyyaa sanaa haa dukkanaaʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">ifa eeggatee haa dhabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">boruu baqaqus hin argin.<verse eid="JOB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10"/>Inni ija koo duraa rakkina dhoksuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:10">balbala gadameessa haadha kootii natti hin cufneetii.<verse eid="JOB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11"/>“Ani maaliif gadameessa haadha kootii keessatti hin badin?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:11">Maaliifis yeruman garaa keessaa baʼetti hin duʼin?<verse eid="JOB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12"/>Jilbawwan na simatan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:12">harmawwan ani hodhus maaliif achitti argaman?<verse eid="JOB 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13"/>Ani silaa yoona nagaan nan ciisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:13">rafees nan boqodhan tureetii;<verse eid="JOB 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14"/>moototaa fi gorsitoota addunyaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:14">warra iddoowwan amma diigamanii jiran ofii isaaniitiif qopheeffatan wajjin,<verse eid="JOB 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15"/>bulchitoota warqee qaban, kanneen manneen isaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:15">meetiidhaan guutatan wajjin nan boqodhan ture.<verse eid="JOB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16"/>Yookaan ani maaliifin akkuma mucaa duʼee garaa baʼee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:16">akkuma daaʼima ifa guyyaa hin arginiitti hin awwaalamin?<verse eid="JOB 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17"/>Achittis namoonni hamoonni jeequu ni dhiisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:17">dadhaboonnis achitti ni boqotu.<verse eid="JOB 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18"/>Boojiʼamtoonni nagaadhaan walii wajjin jiraatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:18">waca cunqursitoota isaaniis hin dhagaʼan.<verse eid="JOB 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19"/>Xinnaa fi guddaan achi jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:19">garbichis gooftaa isaa jalaa bilisoomeera.<verse eid="JOB 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20"/>“Maaliif warra gadadoo keessa jiraniif ifni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:20">warra lubbuun isaanii gadditeef immoo jireenyi kennama?<verse eid="JOB 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21"/>Warra duʼa hawwanii dhabaniif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:21">warra qabeenya dhokfame caalaa duʼa barbaadaniif<verse eid="JOB 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22"/>warra yommuu awwaalamuu gaʼanitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:22">gammachuun guutamanii ililchaniif jireenyi maaliif kennama?<verse eid="JOB 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23"/>Nama karaan isaa duraa dhokateef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:23">nama Waaqni dallaa itti marse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:23">jireenyi maaliif kennama?<verse eid="JOB 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24"/>Gaddi buddeena naa taʼeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:24">aaduun koos akka bishaanii dhangalaʼa.<verse eid="JOB 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25"/>Wanni ani sodaadhe natti dhufeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:25">wanni na naasisus narra gaʼeera.<verse eid="JOB 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26"/>Ani nagaa hin qabu; tasgabbiis hin qabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:26">jeequmsa malee boqonnaa hin qabu.”<verse eid="JOB 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Eliifaaz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1"/>Eliifaaz namichi Teemaan sun akkana jedhee deebise:<verse eid="JOB 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2"/>“Yoo namni tokko sitti dubbachuu yaale, ati ni komattaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:2">Garuu eenyutu dubbachuu dhiisa?<verse eid="JOB 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3"/>Ati akka nama baayʼee barsiifte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:3">akka harka dadhabaa illee jajjabeessite yaadadhu.<verse eid="JOB 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4"/>Dubbiin kee warra gatantaran gargaaree dhaabeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:4">atis jilba laafe jabeessiteerta.<verse eid="JOB 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5"/>Amma garuu rakkinni sirra gaʼe; atis abdii kutatteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:5">rakkinni si miidheera; atis rifatteerta;<verse eid="JOB 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6"/>Waaqa sodaachuun kee irkoo kee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:6">qajeelinni karaa keetiis abdii kee mitii?<verse eid="JOB 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7"/>“Ammas yaadadhu; namni qulqulluun takkumaa badee beekaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:7">Qajeelonni eessatti badanii beeku?<verse eid="JOB 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8"/>Akka ani hubadhetti warri waan hamaa qotatan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:8">kanneen waan hamaa facaasanis isuma haammatu.<verse eid="JOB 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9"/>Isaanis hafuura Waaqni isaanitti baafatuun badu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:9">hafuuraa dheekkamsa isaaniitiinis ni barbadeeffamu.<verse eid="JOB 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10"/>Leenci ni aada; ni gururiʼas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:10">ilkaan leenca saafelaa garuu ni caccaba.<verse eid="JOB 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11"/>Leenci jabaan waan adamsu dhabee ni duʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:11">ilmaan leenca dhaltuus ni bittinnaaʼu.<verse eid="JOB 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12"/>“Dubbiin tokko icciitiidhaan naa fidame;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:12">gurri koos asaasa isaa dhagaʼe.<verse eid="JOB 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13"/>Abjuu halkanii sodaachisaa keessa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:13">yommuu hirribni cimaan nama qabatutti,<verse eid="JOB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14"/>sodaa fi hollachuun na qabatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:14">lafee koo hunda raase.<verse eid="JOB 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15"/>Hafuurri luffi jedhee fuula koo dura darbe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:15">rifeensi dhagna koos kaʼee dhaabate.<verse eid="JOB 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16"/>Innis ni dhaabate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">ani garuu inni maal akka taʼe hubachuu hin dandeenye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:16">Fakkiin tokko ija koo dura dhaabate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">anis sagalee tasgabbii kan akkana jedhu tokkon dhagaʼe:<verse eid="JOB 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17"/>‘Namni duʼa hin oolle, Waaqa caalaa qajeelaa taʼuu dandaʼaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:17">Namni Uumaa isaa caalaa qulqulluu taʼuu dandaʼaa?<verse eid="JOB 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18"/>Waaqni tajaajiltoota isaa hin amanatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:18">ergamoota isaas balleessaa isaaniitiin ni gaafata;<verse eid="JOB 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19"/>yoos warri manneen suphee keessa jiraatan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">warri hundeen isaanii biyyoo taʼe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">warri bilii caalaa burkutaaʼan immoo akkam haa taʼan ree?<verse eid="JOB 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20"/>Isaan ganamaa fi galgala gidduutti burkutaaʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:20">tasumas bara baraan ni badu.<verse eid="JOB 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21"/>Akka isaan ogummaa malee duʼaniif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:21">funyoon dunkaana isaanii hin luqqifamnee?’<verse eid="JOB 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1"/>“Mee waami, namni deebii siif kennu jiraa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:1">Qulqulloota keessaas ati gara isa kamiitti gorta?<verse eid="JOB 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2"/>Nama gowwaa aariitu ajjeesa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:2">raatuus hinaaffaatu galaafata.<verse eid="JOB 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3"/>Namni gowwaan hidda isaa gad fageeffatee nan arge;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:3">manni isaa garuu yoosuma abaarame.<verse eid="JOB 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4"/>Ijoolleen isaa nagaa hin qaban;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:4">isaan karra duratti burkutaaʼan; namni isaan oolchus hin jiru.<verse eid="JOB 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5"/>Namni beelaʼe midhaan isaa qoraattii keessaa iyyuu fuudhee nyaata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">inni dheebotes qabeenya isaa hawwa.<verse eid="JOB 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6"/>Rakkinni biyyoo keessaa hin burquutii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:6">dhiphinnis lafa keessaa hin biqilu.<verse eid="JOB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7"/>Akkuma qaanqeen ibiddaa ol facaʼu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:7">namni rakkinaaf dhalata.<verse eid="JOB 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8"/>“Garuu utuu ana taʼee Waaqa nan barbaaddadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:8">dhimma koos fuula isaa duratti nan dhiʼeeffadhan ture.<verse eid="JOB 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9"/>Inni dinqiiwwan qoranii bira gaʼuu hin dandeenye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:9">hojiiwwan dinqisiisoo lakkaaʼamuu hin dandeenye hojjeta.<verse eid="JOB 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10"/>Inni bokkaadhaan lafa ni quubsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:10">lafa qotiisaas bishaan ni obaasa.<verse eid="JOB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11"/>Warra gad qabaman ol baasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:11">warra gaddanis iddoo nagaatti ol kaasa.<verse eid="JOB 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12"/>Akka hojiin harka isaanii hin milkoofneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:12">inni karoora jalʼootaa ni fashaleessa.<verse eid="JOB 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13"/>Inni ogeeyyii haxxummaa isaaniitiin qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:13">malli jalʼootaa immoo dafee ni bada.<verse eid="JOB 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14"/>Guyyaan dukkana isaanitti taʼa; guyyaa saafaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:14">akka nama dukkana keessa jiruu qaqqabannaadhaan deemu.<verse eid="JOB 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15"/>Inni nama rakkataa goraadee afaan isaanii jalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:15">harka nama jabaa jalaas ni baasa.<verse eid="JOB 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16"/>Kanaafuu hiyyeessi abdii qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:16">jalʼinnis afaan isaa ni cufata.<verse eid="JOB 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17"/>“Namni Waaqni adabu eebbifamaa dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:17">kanaafuu ati adabbii Waaqa Waan Hunda Dandaʼuu hin tuffatin.<verse eid="JOB 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18"/>Inni ni madeessa; ni fayyisas; inni ni cabsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:18">harka isaatiinis deebisee ni fayyisa.<verse eid="JOB 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19"/>Balaa jaʼa jalaa si baasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:19">torba keessattis hin miidhamtu.<verse eid="JOB 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20"/>Bara beelaa duʼa jalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:20">lola keessattis rukuttaa goraadee jalaa si baasa.<verse eid="JOB 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21"/>Ati garaffii arrabaa jalaa ni dhokfamta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:21">yommuu badiisni dhufuttis hin sodaattu.<verse eid="JOB 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22"/>Badiisaa fi beelatti ni kolfita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:22">bineensota lafaas hin sodaattu.<verse eid="JOB 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23"/>Dhagoota bakkee wajjin kakuu galta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:23">bineensonni bosonaas nagaadhaan si wajjin jiraatu.<verse eid="JOB 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24"/>Dunkaanni kee nagaan akka jiru ni beekta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:24">qabeenya kee ni toʼatta; wanni tokko illee si jalaa hin badu.<verse eid="JOB 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25"/>Ijoolleen kee akka baayʼatan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:25">sanyiiwwan kees akkuma marga lafaa akka taʼan ni beekta.<verse eid="JOB 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26"/>Akkuma bissiin midhaanii yeroo isaatti walitti qabamu sana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:26">atis bara dheeraa jiraattee awwaala seenta.<verse eid="JOB 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27"/>“Nu waan kana qoranneerra; innis dhugaa dha.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:27">Kanaafuu qalbeeffadhu; ofii keetiifis beeki.”<verse eid="JOB 5:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1"/>Iyyoobis akkana jedhee deebise:<verse eid="JOB 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2"/>“Utuu gaddi koo safaramee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:2">dhiphinni koo hundis madaalii irra kaaʼamee jiraatee!<verse eid="JOB 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3"/>Waan inni cirracha galaanaa caalaa ulfaatuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:3">ariitiin dubbachuun koo nama hin dinqisiisu ture.<verse eid="JOB 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4"/>Xiyyawwan Waaqa Waan Hunda Dandaʼuu na keessa jiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">hafuurri koo summii isaanii dhuga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">sodaachisuun Waaqaa natti hiriireera.<verse eid="JOB 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5"/>Harreen diidaa utuu marga qabuu halaakaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:5">Yookaan qotiyyoon utuu okaa qabuu baroodaa?<verse eid="JOB 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6"/>Nyaanni hin miʼoofne soogidda malee nyaatamaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:6">Yookaan bishaan hanqaaquu ni miʼaawaa?<verse eid="JOB 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7"/>Ani isa tuquu hin fedhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:7">nyaanni akkasii na dhukkubsa.<verse eid="JOB 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8"/>“Utuu kadhannaan koo deebii argatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:8">Waaqnis waan ani hawwu naa kennee jiraatee,<verse eid="JOB 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9"/>utuu na caccabsuun fedhii Waaqaa taʼee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:9">utuu harki isaa hiikamee na galaafatee!<verse eid="JOB 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10"/>Silaa kun jajjabina naa taʼa ture;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">dhukkuba hamaa keessatti iyyuu nan gammada ture;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">ani dubbii Qulqullicha sanaa hin ganneetii.<verse eid="JOB 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11"/>“Ammas akkan abdadhuuf jabinni koo maali?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:11">Akkan obsuufis humni koo maali?<verse eid="JOB 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12"/>Ani jabina dhagaa qabaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:12">Foon koos naasiidhaa?<verse eid="JOB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13"/>Ani of gargaaruuf humna tokko illee qabaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:13">Ogummaan na keessaa badeera mitii?<verse eid="JOB 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14"/>“Namni michuu isaatiif garaa hin laafne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:14">Waaqa Waan Hunda Dandaʼu iyyuu sodaachuu dhiiseera.<verse eid="JOB 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15"/>Obboloonni koo garuu akka doloolloo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:15">akkuma laga yeroof guutee darbuu gowwoomsitoota;<verse eid="JOB 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16"/>isaan laga cabbiidhaan booraʼee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:16">yommuu cabbiin sun baqutti immoo guutee irra yaaʼuu ti.<verse eid="JOB 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17"/>Lageen yeroo bonni cimutti ni goggogu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:17">yeroo hoʼaatti immoo iddoo isaaniitii badu.<verse eid="JOB 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18"/>Warri gaalaan daldalan karaa isaanii irraa jalʼatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:18">gammoojjiitti namʼanii dhumu.<verse eid="JOB 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19"/>Daldaltoonni Teemaa kanneen gaalaan daldalan bishaan barbaadu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:19">karaa adeemtonni Shebaa immoo isaan abdatu.<verse eid="JOB 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20"/>Isaan waan abdatanii turaniif ni qaanaʼan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:20">achi gaʼaniis waan jedhan wallaalan.<verse eid="JOB 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21"/>Ammas isin akka waan faayidaa hin qabnee taatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:21">gidiraa koo argitanii sodaattan.<verse eid="JOB 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22"/>Ani takkumaa, ‘Waa naaf kennaa’ yookaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:22">‘Qabeenya keessan furii naaf godhaa’ jedheeraa?<verse eid="JOB 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23"/>Yookaan, ‘Harka diinaa jalaa na baasaa’ yookaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:23">‘Harka cunqursitootaa jalaa na furaa’ jedheeraa?<verse eid="JOB 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24"/>“Na barsiisaa; ani nan calʼisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:24">iddoo ani itti dogoggores na argisiisaa.<verse eid="JOB 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25"/>Dubbiin qajeelaan akkam ulfaataa dha!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:25">Falmiin keessan garuu maal mirkaneessa?<verse eid="JOB 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26"/>Isin waan ani jedhu qajeelchuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:26">dubbii nama abdii kutatees akka bubbeetti heduu barbaadduu?<verse eid="JOB 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27"/>Isin ijoollee abbaa hin qabnetti ixaa buufattu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:27">michoota keessaniifis boolla qottu.<verse eid="JOB 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28"/>“Amma garuu yoo fedhii keessan taʼe na ilaalaa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:28">Ani fuula keessan duratti nan sobaa?<verse eid="JOB 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29"/>Deebiʼaa; murtiis hin jalʼisinaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:29">hubadhaa; ani nama qajeelaadhaatii.<verse eid="JOB 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30"/>Jalʼinni arraba koo irra jiraa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:30">Afaan koo daba addaan baasuu hin dandaʼuu?<verse eid="JOB 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1"/>“Jireenyi namaa lafa irratti qabsoo cimaa mitii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:1">Barri isaas akkuma bara nama qacaramaa tokkootii mitii?<verse eid="JOB 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2"/>Akkuma garbicha gaaddisa galgalaa hawwuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:2">yookaan akkuma hojjetaa mindaa isaa eegatu tokkoo,<verse eid="JOB 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3"/>jiʼoonni faayidaa hin qabne naa qoodaman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:3">halkanoonni dhiphinaas naa ramadaman.<verse eid="JOB 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4"/>Yommuun ciisutti, ‘Ani yoomin kaʼa?’ jedheen yaada.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:4">Halkan natti dheerata; anis hamma bariʼutti nan gaggaragala.<verse eid="JOB 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5"/>Nafni koo raammoo fi qonyanyaa uffateera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:5">gogaan koo babbaqaqee malaʼaa jira.<verse eid="JOB 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6"/>“Barri koo kolloo wayya dhooftuu caalaa ariifata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:6">innis abdii malee dhuma.<verse eid="JOB 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7"/>Egaa yaa Waaqayyo, akka jireenyi koo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:7">akkuma qilleensaa taʼe yaadadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:7">iji koo lammata waan gaarii hin argu.<verse eid="JOB 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8"/>Iji amma na argu siʼachi na hin argu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:8">ati na barbaadda; garuu ani hin jiru.<verse eid="JOB 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9"/>Akkuma duumessi bittinnaaʼee badus</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:9">namni awwaalame hin deebiʼu.<verse eid="JOB 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10"/>Inni lammata mana isaatti hin deebiʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:10">iddoon isaas siʼachi isa hin beeku.<verse eid="JOB 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11"/>“Kanaafuu ani cal hin jedhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">ani hafuura koo dhiphate sanaan nan dubbadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">hadhaaʼummaa lubbuu kootiinis nan guunguma.<verse eid="JOB 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12"/>Ati eegduu natti ramaduun kee, ani galaana moo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:12">yookaan bineensa galaanaa ti?<verse eid="JOB 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13"/>Yommuu ani, ‘Sireen koo na jajjabeessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:13">wanni ani irra ciisu guungummii koo naa xinneessa’ jedhutti,<verse eid="JOB 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14"/>ati abjuu keessa na sodaachifta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:14">mulʼataanis na rifachiifta.<verse eid="JOB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15"/>Kanaafuu ani akkasitti jiraachuu irra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:15">of hudhee duʼuu nan filadha.<verse eid="JOB 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16"/>Jireenya koo nan jibba; ani bara baraan hin jiraadhu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:16">Na dhiisi; jiraachuun koo faayidaa hin qabuutii.<verse eid="JOB 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17"/>“Akka ati isa leelliftuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:17">akka qalbii kee isa irra keessuufis namni maali?<verse eid="JOB 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18"/>Ati ganama ganama isa xiinxaltee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:18">yeroo yerootti isa qorta.<verse eid="JOB 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19"/>Ati ija kee narraa hin buqqiftuu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:19">Hamma ani hancufa liqimsutti kophaa koo na hin dhiiftuu?<verse eid="JOB 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20"/>Yaa isa nama eegdu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">yoon cubbuu hojjedhe iyyuu ani maalan si godha?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:20">Ati maaliif waan itti akeekkattu na godhatte?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">Ani baʼaa sitti taʼeeraa?<verse eid="JOB 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21"/>Ati maaliif balleessaa koo irra dabartee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">cubbuu koo illee naaf hin dhiifne?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:21">Yeroon ani itti biyyoo keessa ciisu gaʼeeraatii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">ati na barbaadda; garuu ani hin argamu.”<verse eid="JOB 7:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Bildaad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1"/>Bildaad Shuhaahichi akkana jedhee deebise:<verse eid="JOB 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2"/>“Ati hamma yoomiitti waan akkasii dubbatta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:2">Dubbiin kee bubbee jabaa dha.<verse eid="JOB 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3"/>Waaqni murtii qajeelaa jalʼisaa ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:3">Waaqni Waan Hunda Dandaʼu waan qajeelaa jalʼisaa?<verse eid="JOB 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4"/>Yommuu ijoolleen kee cubbuu isatti hojjetanitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:4">inni adabbii cubbuu isaaniitti dabarsee isaan kenne.<verse eid="JOB 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5"/>Ati garuu yoo Waaqa barbaadatte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:5">Waaqa Waan Hunda Dandaʼu yoo waammatte,<verse eid="JOB 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6"/>yoo ati qulqulluu fi qajeelaa taate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:6">inni waaʼee keetiif ammuma kaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:6">jireenya qajeelummaa kees siif deebisa.<verse eid="JOB 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7"/>Jalqabni kee xinnaa taʼu illee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:7">dhumni kee baayʼee guddaa taʼa.<verse eid="JOB 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8"/>“Dhaloota darbe gaafadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:8">waan abbootiin isaanii qoratanii bira gaʼanis hubadhu;<verse eid="JOB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9"/>nu waan kaleessa dhalanneef waa tokko illee hin beeknuutii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:9">baroonni keenyas lafa irratti akkuma gaaddidduu ti.<verse eid="JOB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10"/>Isaan si hin barsiisanii? Sittis hin himanii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:10">Dubbii garaa isaanii keessa jirus hin dubbatanii?<verse eid="JOB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11"/>Dhallaadduun lafa caffee hin taʼinitti guddataa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:11">Shambaqqoonis bishaan malee lalisaa?<verse eid="JOB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12"/>Isaan utuma guddachaa jiranuu, utuu hin muramin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:12">biqiltuuwwan kaan dura dafanii gogu.<verse eid="JOB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13"/>Dhumni warra Waaqa irraanfataniis akkasuma taʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:13">abdiin warra Waaqa hin beeknees ni bada.<verse eid="JOB 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14"/>Abdiin isaa akkuma salphaatti cita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:14">ofitti amanachuun isaas manʼee sariitii ti.<verse eid="JOB 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15"/>Inni manʼee isaatti irkata; manʼeen sun garuu hin dhaabatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:15">itti maxxanas; manʼeen sun garuu dandaʼee isa hin baatu.<verse eid="JOB 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16"/>Inni akka biqiltuu aduu keessatti bishaan obaafamee lalisuutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:16">dameewwan isaa lafa biqiltuu irra diriirfatuu ti.<verse eid="JOB 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17"/>Hidda isaa tuullaa dhagaatti marata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:17">kattaa gidduus iddoo jiraatu ni barbaaddata.<verse eid="JOB 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18"/>Yommuu inni iddoo isaatii badutti garuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:18">iddoon sun, ‘Ani si argee hin beeku’ jedhee isa gana.<verse eid="JOB 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19"/>Kunis dhuma jireenya isaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:19">biqiltuuwwan biraas lafaa ni biqilu.<verse eid="JOB 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20"/>“Waaqni nama hirʼina hin qabne hin gatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:20">yookaan harka jalʼootaa hin jabeessu.<verse eid="JOB 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21"/>Inni afaan kee kolfaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:21">arraba kee immoo ililleedhaan ni guuta.<verse eid="JOB 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22"/>Warri si jibban salphina uffatu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:22">Dunkaanni jalʼootaas siʼachi hin jiraatu.”<verse eid="JOB 8:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1"/>Iyyoob akkana jedhee deebise:<verse eid="JOB 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2"/>“Ani akka wanni kun dhugaa taʼe beeka.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:2">Namni garuu akkamitti fuula Waaqaa duratti qajeelaa taʼuu dandaʼa?<verse eid="JOB 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3"/>Namni tokko yoo isa wajjin falmuu barbaade</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:3">kuma keessaa siʼa tokko illee isaaf deebisuu hin dandaʼu.<verse eid="JOB 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4"/>Ogummaan isaa gad fagoo dha; humni isaas guddaa dha.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:4">Namni isaan mormee utuu hin miidhamin hafu jiraa?<verse eid="JOB 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5"/>Inni utuu isaan hin beekin tulluuwwan iddoo isaaniitii buqqisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:5">dheekkamsa isaatiinis isaan gaggaragalcha.<verse eid="JOB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6"/>Lafa iddoo isheetii ni sochoosa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:6">utubaawwan ishees ni raasa.<verse eid="JOB 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7"/>Inni biiftuu ni ajaja; isheenis hin baatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:7">urjiiwwanis chaappaadhaan ni cufa.<verse eid="JOB 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8"/>Isa qofatu samiiwwan diriirsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:8">dambalii galaanaa irras ni deema.<verse eid="JOB 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9"/>Urjiiwwan Amaaketaa fi urjii sadee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:9">Urjii torbii fi tuuta ‘Urjiiwwan Kibbaa’ jedhaman isatu uume.<verse eid="JOB 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10"/>Inni wantoota gurguddaa qoratanii bira gaʼuun hin dandaʼamne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:10">dinqiiwwan hin lakkaaʼamne hojjeta.<verse eid="JOB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11"/>Yommuu inni na bira darbu ani isa arguu hin dandaʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:11">yommuu inni na cina deemus ani isa hubachuu hin dandaʼu.<verse eid="JOB 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12"/>Yoo inni butee deeme eenyutu isa dhowwuu dandaʼa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:12">Eenyutus, ‘Ati maal hojjettaa?’ isaan jechuu dandaʼa?<verse eid="JOB 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13"/>Waaqni dheekkamsa isaa hin deebisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:13">warri Raʼaabin gargaaran iyyuu gad deebiʼu.<verse eid="JOB 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14"/>“Yoos ani akkamittan isatti falmuu dandaʼa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:14">Isatti falmuufis akkamittan dubbii filachuu dandaʼa?<verse eid="JOB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15"/>Ani nama balleessaa hin qabne utuun taʼe iyyuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:15">isaaf deebisuu hin dandaʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:15">abbaa Murtii koo araara kadhachuu qofa nan dandaʼa.<verse eid="JOB 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16"/>Yoo ani isa waammadhee inni naa deebise illee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:16">akka inni na dhagaʼu ani hin amanu.<verse eid="JOB 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17"/>Inni bubbee hamaadhaan na caccabsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:17">madaa koos sababii malee natti baayʼisa.<verse eid="JOB 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18"/>Inni waan hadhaaʼaadhaan na guute malee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:18">akka ani hafuura fudhadhuuf illee yeroo naaf hin kennine.<verse eid="JOB 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19"/>Waaʼee jabinaa taanaan inni jabaa dha!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">Waaʼee murtii qajeelaas taanaan eenyutu isa waamuu dandaʼa?<verse eid="JOB 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20"/>Utuu ani nama balleessaa hin qabne taʼe iyyuu afaan koo natti mura;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:20">utuma ani hirʼina hin qabaannes yakkamaa taʼuu koo hima.<verse eid="JOB 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21"/>“Ani hirʼina qabaachuu baadhu iyyuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:21">waaʼee ofii kootii hin yaaddaʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:21">jireenya koos nan tuffadha.<verse eid="JOB 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22"/>Wanni hundinuu tokkuma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:22">kanaafuu ani, ‘Inni isa hirʼina hin qabnes,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:22">isa hamaas ni balleessa’ nan jedha.<verse eid="JOB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23"/>Yommuu dhaʼichi buʼee duʼa tasaa fidutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:23">inni badiisa warra yakka hin qabneetti ni qoosa.<verse eid="JOB 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24"/>Yommuu lafti harka hamootaa jala galtutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">inni ija abbootii murtii ishee ni jaamsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">kun yoo isa taʼuu baate, egaa eenyu ree?<verse eid="JOB 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25"/>“Barri jireenya koo nama fiigu caalaa ariifata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:25">utuu gammachuu tokko illee hin argin darba.<verse eid="JOB 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26"/>Inni akkuma bidiruu dhallaadduu irraa hojjetamee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:26">akkuma risaa waa butachuuf gad barrisuu ariifata.<verse eid="JOB 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27"/>Yoo ani, ‘Guungummii koo nan dhiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:27">nyaara guuruus dhiisee nan seeqa’ jedhe,<verse eid="JOB 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28"/>ani amma iyyuu dhiphina koo hunda nan sodaadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:28">akka ati akka nama balleessaa hin qabneetti na hin hedne nan beekaatii.<verse eid="JOB 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29"/>Erga yakkamaa taʼuun koo beekamee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:29">ani maaliifin akkasumaan dadhaba ree?<verse eid="JOB 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30"/>Utuma ani saamunaadhaan dhiqadhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:30">handoodeedhaanis harka koo qulqulleeffadhe iyyuu,<verse eid="JOB 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31"/>ati hamma uffanni koos na balfutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:31">boolla keessa na dhidhimsita.<verse eid="JOB 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32"/>“Akka ani isaa deebisuu fi mana murtiittis wal falminuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:32">inni akka koo nama foonii miti.<verse eid="JOB 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33"/>Utuu namni nu lamaan irra harka kaaʼu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:33">kan gidduu keenyattis araara buusu tokko jiraatee,<verse eid="JOB 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34"/>utuu Waaqni ulee isaa narraa kaasee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:34">silaa naasisuun isaa na hin sodaachisu ture.<verse eid="JOB 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35"/>Silaa ani utuun isa hin sodaatin nan dubbadhan ture;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:35">haalan amma keessa jiruun garuu hin dandaʼu.<verse eid="JOB 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1"/>“Ani jireenya koo akka malee jibbeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:1">kanaafuu caalchisee nan guunguma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:1">hadhaaʼummaa lubbuu kootiinis nan dubbadha.<verse eid="JOB 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2"/>Waaqaanis akkana nan jedha:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:2">Ati maaliin akka na himattu natti himi malee natti hin murin.<verse eid="JOB 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3"/>Hojii jalʼootaa gammachuudhaan fudhattee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">ana immoo yommuu cunqursitu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">hojii harka keetiis yommuu tuffattu sitti tolaa?<verse eid="JOB 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4"/>Ati ija foonii qabdaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:4">Akka namni ilaaluttis ni ilaaltaa?<verse eid="JOB 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5"/>Barri kee akka bara namaatii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:5">Yookaan waggoonni kee akka waggoota namaatii?<verse eid="JOB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6"/>Yoos ati maaliif balleessaa koo barbaaddee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:6">cubbuu koo qoratta?<verse eid="JOB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7"/>Taʼus ati akka ani yakka hin qabnee fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:7">akka namni harka keetii na baasu tokko iyyuu hin jirre ni beekta.<verse eid="JOB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8"/>“Harki kee tolchee na uume.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:8">Ati amma deebitee na balleessitaa?<verse eid="JOB 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9"/>Akka supheetti na tolchuu kee yaadadhu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:9">Ati amma gara biyyootti na deebiftaa?<verse eid="JOB 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10"/>Ati akka aannanii na hin dhangalaafnee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:10">Akka baaduus na hin itichinee?<verse eid="JOB 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11"/>Ati gogaa fi foon natti uffifte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:11">lafee fi ribuudhaanis walitti hodhitee na tolchite.<verse eid="JOB 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12"/>Ati jireenya naa kennitee gaarummaa natti argisiifte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:12">kunuunsi kees hafuura koo naa eege.<verse eid="JOB 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13"/>“Ati garuu waan kana hunda garaatti qabatte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:13">anis akka wanni kun yaada kee keessa jiru nan beeka.<verse eid="JOB 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14"/>Ati yoo ani cubbuu hojjedhe na argita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:14">balleessaa koos utuu hin adabin bira hin dabartu.<verse eid="JOB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15"/>Yoo ani yakka hojjedhe, anaaf wayyoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">Ani yoo nama balleessaa hin qabne taʼe illee, <optbreak/> mataa koo ol qabachuu hin dandaʼu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:15">ani salphina uffadhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">dhiphina keessa seeneeraatii.<verse eid="JOB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16"/>Yoo ani mataa ol qabadhe ati akka leenca waa adamsuu na adamsita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:16">humna kee sodaachisaa sanas ammumaa amma natti argisiifta.<verse eid="JOB 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17"/>Ati dhuga baatota haaraa natti fiddee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">dheekkamsa kee natti dabalta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">loltuus natti fidda.<verse eid="JOB 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18"/>“Egaa ati maaliif gadameessa keessaa na baafte?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:18">Utuu iji tokko iyyuu na hin argin utuun duʼee.<verse eid="JOB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19"/>Ani utuun dhalachuu baadhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:19">yookaan utuun akkuman dhaladheen awwaalamee jiraadhee!<verse eid="JOB 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20"/>Barri koo gabaabaan dhumaa jira mitii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:20">Akka ani yeroo xinnoof gammaduuf narraa deebiʼi;<verse eid="JOB 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21"/>utuu ani lafa dhaqanii hin deebine,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:21">biyya dimimmisaa fi dukkana limixii hin dhaqin dura,<verse eid="JOB 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22"/>gara biyya dimimmisaaʼaa akka dukkanaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">biyya gaaddidduu duʼaatiin guutame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">kan ifni iyyuu akkuma dukkanaa taʼee hin dhaqin, narraa deebiʼi.”<verse eid="JOB 10:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Zoofaari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1"/>Zoofaari Naaʼimaatichi akkana jedhee deebise:<verse eid="JOB 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2"/>“Dubbiiwwan kunneen hundi deebii argachuu hin qabanii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:2">Dubbii baayʼisuun qajeelaa nama godhaa?<verse eid="JOB 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3"/>Of jajuun kee afaan nama qabachiisaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:3">Yommuu ati qoostu namni si ifatu hin jiruu?<verse eid="JOB 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4"/>Ati Waaqaan, ‘Barsiisni koo qulqulluu dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:4">ani fuula kee duratti hirʼina hin qabu’ jetta.<verse eid="JOB 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5"/>Maaloo utuu Waaqni sitti dubbatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:5">utuu afaan isaas sitti saaqqatee<verse eid="JOB 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6"/>icciitii ogummaa siif ibsee ani akkamin hawwa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">Ogummaan dhugaan bifa lama qabaatii.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">Kanaafuu Waaqni cubbuu kee muraasa akka siif irraanfate beeki.<verse eid="JOB 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7"/>“Icciitii Waaqaa qorattee bira gaʼuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:7">yookaan yaada Waaqa Waan Hunda Dandaʼuu qorattee bira gaʼuu dandeessaa?<verse eid="JOB 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8"/>Isaan samiiwwan caalaa ol fagaatu; ati maal gochuu dandeessa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:8">Qilee awwaalaa caalaas gad fagaatu; ati maal beekuu dandeessa?<verse eid="JOB 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9"/>Safarri isaa lafa caalaa dheerata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:9">galaana caalaa balʼata.<verse eid="JOB 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10"/>“Yoo inni dhufee mana hidhaatti si galche,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:10">yoo waldaa murtiis walitti qabe eenyutu isa dhowwuu dandaʼa?<verse eid="JOB 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11"/>Dhugumaan inni sobdoota ni beeka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:11">inni yommuu jalʼina argutti hin qalbeeffatuu?<verse eid="JOB 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12"/>Yoo harreen diidaa nama taʼee dhalate malee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:12">gowwaan ogeessa taʼuu hin dandaʼu.<verse eid="JOB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13"/>“Taʼus yoo ati yaada kee gara isaatti deebiftee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:13">harka kees gara isaatti diriirsite,<verse eid="JOB 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14"/>cubbuu harka kee keessa jiru yoo of irraa fageessite,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:14">akka wanni hamaanis dunkaana kee keessa hin jiraanne yoo goote,<verse eid="JOB 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15"/>ati qaanii tokko malee fuula kee ol qabachuu dandeessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:15">sodaa tokko malees jabaattee dhaabatta.<verse eid="JOB 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16"/>Ati dhugumaan rakkina kee ni irraanfatta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:16">akkuma lolaa darbeettis ni lakkoofta.<verse eid="JOB 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17"/>Jireenyi kee aduu saafaa caalaa ifa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:17">dukkanni isaas akkuma barii ganamaa taʼa.<verse eid="JOB 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18"/>Waan abdiin jiruuf ati hin sodaattu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:18">naannoo kee ni ilaalta; nagaadhaanis ni boqotta.<verse eid="JOB 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19"/>Ati ni rafta; namni tokko iyyuu si hin sodaachisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:19">namoonni baayʼeenis fuula kee barbaadu.<verse eid="JOB 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20"/>Iji hamootaa ni dadhaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:20">karaan ittiin baqatanis isaan jalaa bada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:20">abdiin isaaniis duʼa qofa.”<verse eid="JOB 11:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1"/>Iyyoob akkana jedhee deebise:<verse eid="JOB 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2"/>“Nama jechuun dhugumaan isin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:2">ogummaanis isin wajjin duuti!<verse eid="JOB 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3"/>Garuu anis akkuma keessan sammuun qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">ani isinii gad miti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">Namni waan akkanaa hin beekne eenyu?<verse eid="JOB 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4"/>“Ani nama Waaqa waammatee deebii argate taʼu illee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">michoota koo biratti nama kolfaa taʼeera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">Ani utuun nama qajeelaa hirʼina hin qabne taʼee jiruu nama kolfaa taʼeera.<verse eid="JOB 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5"/>Warri itti tole rakkinatti qoosu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:5">nama kufuuf miilli isaa mucucaateenis kun hiree isaati jedhu.<verse eid="JOB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6"/>Dunkaanni saamtotaa hin jeeqamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:6">warri Waaqa isaanii harkatti baatanii jooran,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:6">warri Waaqa dheekkamsiisan nagaan jiraatu.<verse eid="JOB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7"/>“Mee horii gaafadhu; isaan si barsiisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:7">yookaan simbirroota samii gaafadhu; isaan sitti himu;<verse eid="JOB 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8"/>yookaan lafatti dubbadhu; inni si barsiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:8">yookaan qurxummiiwwan galaanaa sitti haa himan.<verse eid="JOB 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9"/>Akka harki <char style="nd">Waaqayyoo</char> waan kana hojjete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:9">isaan kanneen hunda keessaa eenyutu hin beekne?<verse eid="JOB 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10"/>Lubbuun uumama hundaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:10">hafuurri nama hundaas harka isaa keessa jira.<verse eid="JOB 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11"/>Akkuma arrabni nyaata afaaniin qabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:11">gurris dubbii dhagaʼee addaan hin baasuu?<verse eid="JOB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12"/>Ogummaan jaarsolii biratti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:12">hubannaanis warra umuriin dheerate biratti argama mitii?<verse eid="JOB 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13"/>“Ogummaa fi humni kan Waaqaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:13">gorsii fi hubannaanis kan isaa ti.<verse eid="JOB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14"/>Waan inni diigu eenyu iyyuu deebisee ijaaruu hin dandaʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:14">nama inni hidhe eenyu iyyuu hiikuu hin dandaʼu.<verse eid="JOB 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15"/>Yoo inni bishaan dhowwate, hongeetu buʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:15">yoo inni gad dhiise immoo biyya balleessa.<verse eid="JOB 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16"/>Jabinnii fi ogummaan kan isaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:16">namni gowwoomfamuu fi inni gowwoomsus kanuma isaa ti.<verse eid="JOB 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17"/>Inni gorsitoota qullaa deemsisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:17">abbootii murtiis gowwoota godha.<verse eid="JOB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18"/>Inni mootota irraa hidhaa hiikee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:18">mudhii isaaniitti sabbata hidha.<verse eid="JOB 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19"/>Luboota qullaa deemsisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:19">jajjabeeyyiis ni gaggaragalcha.<verse eid="JOB 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20"/>Gorsitoota amanamoo afaan qabachiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:20">hubannaa jaarsoliis irraa fuudha.<verse eid="JOB 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21"/>Warra kabajamootti salphina fida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:21">warra jajjaboo immoo hidhata hiikachiisa.<verse eid="JOB 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22"/>Inni icciitii dukkanaa keessaa ifatti baasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:22">dukkana limixiis ifatti geeddara.<verse eid="JOB 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23"/>Inni saboota ni guddisa; ni balleessas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:23">saboota ni baayʼisa; ni bittinneessas.<verse eid="JOB 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24"/>Bulchitoota addunyaa hubannaa malee hambisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:24">gammoojjii daandii hin qabne keessas isaan joorsa.<verse eid="JOB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25"/>Isaan dukkana ifa hin qabne keessa qaqqabannaadhaan deemu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:25">inni akka isaan akkuma nama machaaʼeetti gatantaranis ni godha.<verse eid="JOB 12:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1"/>“Waan kana hunda iji koo argeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:1">gurri koos dhagaʼee hubateera.<verse eid="JOB 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2"/>Waan isin beektan anis beeka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:2">ani isinii gad miti.<verse eid="JOB 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3"/>Ani garuu Waaqa Waan Hunda Dandaʼutti nan dubbadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:3">waaʼee dhimma koos Waaqatti falmuu nan barbaada.<verse eid="JOB 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4"/>Isin garuu sobaan nama faaltu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:4">hundi keessan abbootii qorichaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:4">kanneen faayidaa hin qabnee dha!<verse eid="JOB 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5"/>Isin yoo cal jettan maal qaba!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:5">Wanni sun ogummaa isiniif taʼa.<verse eid="JOB 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6"/>Amma falmii koo dhagaʼaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:6">kadhannaa afaan kootiis dhaggeeffadhaa.<verse eid="JOB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7"/>Isin jalʼinaan Waaqaaf dubbattuu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:7">Gowwoomsaadhaanis isaaf odeessituu?<verse eid="JOB 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8"/>Isaaf ni loogduu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:8">Waaqaafis ni falmituu?<verse eid="JOB 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9"/>Yoo inni isin qore wanni gaariin isin irraa argamaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:9">Isin akka nama gowwoomsitan, isa gowwoomsuu dandeessuu?<verse eid="JOB 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10"/>Yoo isin dhoksaadhaan loogii hojjettan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:10">inni dhugumaan isinitti dheekkama.<verse eid="JOB 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11"/>Surraan isaa isin hin sodaachisuu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:11">Sodaachisuun isaa isinitti hin dhagaʼamuu?<verse eid="JOB 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12"/>Fakkeenyi keessan fakkeenya daaraa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:12">daʼoon keessanis daʼoo suphee ti.<verse eid="JOB 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13"/>“Akka ani dubbadhuuf isin cal jedhaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:13">ergasii wanni barbaade natti haa dhufu.<verse eid="JOB 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14"/>Ani maaliifin foon koo ilkaan kootiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:14">lubbuu koos harka kootiin qabadha?<verse eid="JOB 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15"/>Yoo inni na ajjeese iyyuu ani isa nan abdadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:15">waaʼee dhimma kootii illee fuula isaa duratti nan falmadha.<verse eid="JOB 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16"/>Kun fayyina koo ni taʼa; warri Waaqatti hin bulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:16">fuula isaa duratti dhiʼaachuu hin dandaʼaniitii!<verse eid="JOB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17"/>Dubbii koo qalbeeffadhaa dhaggeeffadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:17">waan ani jedhus gurri keessan haa dhagaʼu.<verse eid="JOB 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18"/>Kunoo ani himata koo qopheeffadheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:18">akka inni murtii qajeelaa naa kennus nan beeka.<verse eid="JOB 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19"/>Namni na himatu jiraa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:19">Yoo jiraate, ani nan calʼisa; nan duʼas.<verse eid="JOB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20"/>“Yaa Waaqayyo, ati wantoota kanneen lamaan naa kenni malee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:20">ani fuula kee duraa hin dhokadhu.<verse eid="JOB 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21"/>Harka kee narraa fageessi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:21">sodaachisni kees na hin rifachiisin.<verse eid="JOB 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22"/>Ergasii na waami; anis nan owwaadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:22">yookaan nan dubbadha; ati immoo deebii naa kennita.<verse eid="JOB 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23"/>Ani balleessaa fi cubbuu hammamin hojjedhe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:23">Yakka kootii fi cubbuu koo na beeksisi.<verse eid="JOB 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24"/>Ati maaliif fuula kee dhokfattee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:24">akka diinaatti na ilaalta?<verse eid="JOB 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25"/>Baala qilleensi harcaase ni ciccirtaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:25">Habaqii gogaa ni ariitaa?<verse eid="JOB 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26"/>Ati waan ittiin na hadheessitu natti barreessitaatii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:26">cubbuu dargaggummaa kootiis na dhaalchifta.<verse eid="JOB 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27"/>Miilla koo jirma gidduu galchita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">faana miilla kootiitti mallattoo gootee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">karaa koo hunda xiyyeeffattee duukaa buuta.<verse eid="JOB 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28"/>“Namnis akkuma waan bososeetti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:28">akkuma wayyaa biliin nyaateetti ni dhuma.<verse eid="JOB 13:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1"/>“Nama dubartoota irraa dhalate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:1">barri isaa gabaabaa fi kan rakkinaan guutamee dha.<verse eid="JOB 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2"/>Inni akkuma daraaraa ni biqila; ni coollagas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:2">akkuma gaaddidduu ariifatee darba malee hin turu.<verse eid="JOB 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3"/>Iji kee nama akkasii xiyyeeffatee ilaalaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:3">Ati murtiif fuula kee duratti isa fiddaa?<verse eid="JOB 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4"/>Eenyutu waan xuraaʼaa keessaa waan qulqullaaʼaa baasuu dandaʼa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:4">Namni tokko iyyuu hin dandaʼu!<verse eid="JOB 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5"/>Barri jireenya namaa murtaaʼaa dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">baayʼinni jiʼoota isaas si bira jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">daangaa inni darbuu hin dandeenye daangessiteefii jirta.<verse eid="JOB 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6"/>Hamma inni akka hojjetaa tokkootti bara isaa raawwatutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:6">fuula kee isa irraa deebifadhu; isas dhiisi.<verse eid="JOB 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7"/>“Mukni illee abdii qaba:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">Yoo murame deebiʼee ni lata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">dameen isaa haaraanis hin gogu.<verse eid="JOB 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8"/>Yoo gufuun isaa lafa keessatti dulloomee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:8">gufuun isaa biyyoo keessatti tortore iyyuu,<verse eid="JOB 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9"/>foolii bishaaniitiin lata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:9">akka biqiltuuttis damee ni baafata.<verse eid="JOB 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10"/>Namni garuu duʼee awwaalama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:10">lubbuun isaa keessaa baati; innis hin jiraatu.<verse eid="JOB 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11"/>Akkuma bishaan galaanaa gogu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:11">yookaan lagnis dhumee gogu sana,<verse eid="JOB 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12"/>namnis akkasuma ni ciisa; hin kaʼus;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">hamma samiiwwan darbanittis hin dammaqu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">yookaan hirribaa hin kaʼu.<verse eid="JOB 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13"/>“Maaloo utuu awwaala keessa na dhoksitee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">hamma dheekkamsi kee darbutti na haguugdee!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:13">Maaloo utuu beellama naa kennitee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">ergasii immoo na yaadattee!<verse eid="JOB 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14"/>Namni tokko yoo duʼe deebiʼee ni jiraataa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">Ani hamma haaromfamni koo dhufutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">bara rakkoo koo hunda obsaan nan eeggadha.<verse eid="JOB 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15"/>Ati na waamta; anis si jalaa nan owwaadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:15">hojii harka keetiis ni hawwita.<verse eid="JOB 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16"/>Yeroo sana ati tarkaanfii koo ni lakkoofta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:16">cubbuu koo garuu hin toʼattu.<verse eid="JOB 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17"/>Yakki koo korojootti naqamee chaappeffama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:17">ati cubbuu koo ni haguugda.<verse eid="JOB 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18"/>“Garuu akkuma tulluun lolaadhaan dhiqamee jigu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:18">kattaanis iddoo isaatii buqqaʼu sana,<verse eid="JOB 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19"/>akkuma bishaan dhagaa nyaatee haphisu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:19">akkuma lolaan biyyoo dhiqu sana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:19">atis akkasuma abdii namaa ni balleessita.<verse eid="JOB 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20"/>Ati bara baraan isa ni moota; innis ni bada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:20">bifa isaa ni geeddarta; of irraas isa fageessita.<verse eid="JOB 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21"/>Yoo ilmaan isaa ulfina argatan inni hin beeku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:21">yoo isaan salphatanis hin argu.<verse eid="JOB 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22"/>Dhukkuba dhagna isaa qofatu isatti dhagaʼama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:22">inni mataa isaa qofaaf booʼa.”<verse eid="JOB 14:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Eliifaaz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1"/>Eliifaaz Teemaanichi akkana jedhee deebise:<verse eid="JOB 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2"/>“Namni ogeessi tokko dubbii faayidaa hin qabneen deebii kennaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:2">Yookaan bubbee baʼa biiftuutiin garaa isaa guutataa?<verse eid="JOB 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3"/>Inni dubbii faayidaa hin qabneen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:3">haasaa buʼaa hin qabneenis ni falmaa?<verse eid="JOB 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4"/>Ati garuu Waaqa sodaachuu ni tuffatta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:4">Waaqa kadhachuu illee nama dhowwita.<verse eid="JOB 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5"/>Cubbuun kee afaan kee ni barsiifti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:5">atis afaan jalʼootaa filatta.<verse eid="JOB 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6"/>Afaanuma keetu sitti mura malee afaan koo miti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:6">arrabuma keetu ragaa sitti taʼa.<verse eid="JOB 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7"/>“Situ nama hunda dura dhalatee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:7">Yookaan situ tulluuwwan dura argamee?<verse eid="JOB 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8"/>Ati dhoksaa Waaqaa dhageesseertaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:8">Ogummaas ofuma keetiif dhuunfattaa?<verse eid="JOB 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9"/>Wanni ati beektu kan nu hin beekne maali?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:9">Hubannaan ati qabdu kan nu hin qabne maali?<verse eid="JOB 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10"/>Namoonni arrii baasanii fi kanneen jaaran,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:10">warri abbaa kee iyyuu caalaa dullooman nu gidduu jiru.<verse eid="JOB 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11"/>Gorsi Waaqaa kan nama jajjabeessu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:11">dubbiin suutaan sitti himame sun si hanqatee?<verse eid="JOB 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12"/>Yaadni kee maaliif si fudhatee bada?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:12">Ijas maaliif babaafta?<verse eid="JOB 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13"/>Wanni akka ati Waaqatti aartu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:13">akka dubbiin akkasiis afaan keetii baʼu godhe maali?<verse eid="JOB 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14"/>“Akka qulqulluu taʼuuf namni maali?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:14">Yookaan akka qajeeltota taʼaniif warri dubartoota irraa dhalatan maali?<verse eid="JOB 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15"/>Yoo Waaqni qulqulloota isaa illee amanuu baatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:15">samiiwwan iyyuu fuula isaa duratti qulqulluu taʼuu baatan,<verse eid="JOB 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16"/>yoos sanyiin namaa inni hamaa fi xuraaʼaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:16">kan akkuma bishaaniitti cubbuu dhugu sun <optbreak/> hammam hammasii gad haa taʼu ree!<verse eid="JOB 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17"/>“Na dhaggeeffadhu; ani siifan ibsaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:17">waanan arges sitti nan hima;<verse eid="JOB 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18"/>waan namoonni ogeeyyiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:18">waan abbootii isaanii irraa dhagaʼan keessaa tokko illee utuu hin dhoksin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:18">odeessan sana nan dubbadha;<verse eid="JOB 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19"/>biyyattiin abbootii isaanii qofaaf kennamte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:19">alagaan tokko iyyuu isaan gidduu hin jiraanne.<verse eid="JOB 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20"/>Namni dabaan bara jireenya isaa guutuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:20">gara jabeessis bara isaaf qoodame guutuu ni rakkata.<verse eid="JOB 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21"/>Sagaleen sodaachisaan gurra isaatti ni iyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:21">utuma inni nagaan jiraatuus saamtonni tasuma itti dhufu.<verse eid="JOB 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22"/>Inni akka deebiʼee dukkana keessaa baʼu hin amanu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:22">goraadeetu isa eeggata.<verse eid="JOB 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23"/>Inni waan nyaatamu barbaacha asii fi achi joora;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:23">akka guyyaan dukkanaa dhiʼaates ni beeka.<verse eid="JOB 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24"/>Dhiphinaa fi gaddi isa sodaachisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:24">akkuma mootii lolaaf qophaaʼeettis isatti cimu;<verse eid="JOB 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25"/>inni harka isaa Waaqatti ol fudhatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:25">Waaqa Waan Hunda Dandaʼus tuffateera;<verse eid="JOB 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26"/>gaachana yabbuu fi jabaa qabatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:26">isaan mormuuf mata jabinaan baʼeera.<verse eid="JOB 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27"/>“Yoo fuulli isaa coomaan haguugamee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:27">mudhiin isaa foon baasee iitaʼe iyyuu,<verse eid="JOB 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28"/>inni magaalaawwan barbadaaʼan keessa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">manneen namni tokko iyyuu keessa hin jiraanne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">kanneen diigamanii tuulamuu gaʼan keessa jiraata.<verse eid="JOB 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29"/>Inni siʼachi hin sooromu; qabeenyi isaas hin jiraatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:29">yookaan qabeenyi isaa lafa irra hin turu.<verse eid="JOB 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30"/>Inni dukkana jalaa hin baʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">arrabni ibiddaa damee isaa ni gogsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">hafuurri afaan Waaqaatii baʼus isa fudhata.<verse eid="JOB 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31"/>Inni sababii beenyaa tokko illee hin arganneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:31">waan faayidaa hin qabne amanachuudhaan of hin gowwoomsin.<verse eid="JOB 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32"/>Inni utuu yeroon isaa hin gaʼin ni coollaga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:32">dameen isaas hin lalisu.<verse eid="JOB 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33"/>Inni akka muka wayinii iji isaa utuu hin bilchaatin irraa funaanamee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:33">akka ejersa daraaraa isaa of irraa harcaasee ni taʼa.<verse eid="JOB 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34"/>Gareen warra Waaqaaf hin bullee ni maseena;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:34">ibiddis dunkaana warra mattaʼaa jaallatanii ni guba.<verse eid="JOB 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35"/>Isaan rakkina ulfaaʼanii hammina dhalan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:35">garaan isaaniis jalʼina yaada.”<verse eid="JOB 15:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1"/>Iyyoobis akkana jedhee deebise:<verse eid="JOB 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2"/>“Ani waan akkanaa baayʼee dhagaʼeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:2">hundi keessan jajjabeessitoota nama dhiphistanii dha!<verse eid="JOB 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3"/>Haasaan faayidaa hin qabne kun hin dhumuu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:3">Wanni akka ati oduu dheeressituuf si tuttuqu maali?<verse eid="JOB 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4"/>Utuu isin iddoo koo jiraattanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">silaa ani akkuma keessan kana nan dubbadha ture;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:4">dubbii miʼooftuu dubbachuudhaanis</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">mataa koo isinitti nan raasan ture.<verse eid="JOB 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5"/>Ani afaan kootiin isin jajjabeessee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:5">gorsi arraba kootiis qabbana isinii kenna ture.<verse eid="JOB 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6"/>“Yoo ani dubbadhe dhukkubni koo natti hin wayyaaʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:6">cal jedhus na hin dhiisu.<verse eid="JOB 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7"/>Yaa Waaqi, ati dhugumaan na dadhabsiifteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:7">warra mana koo jiru hundas balleessiteerta.<verse eid="JOB 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8"/>Ati na kokotteessite; kunis ragaa natti taʼe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:8">akka malee huqqachuun koos ifatti baʼee na saaxile.<verse eid="JOB 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9"/>Waaqni dheekkamsa isaatiin rukutee na ciccire;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">ilkaan isaa natti qarate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">diinni koo ija isaa natti babaase.<verse eid="JOB 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10"/>Namoonni natti qoosuuf afaan banatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:10">tuffiidhaan maddii koo kabalan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:10">tokko taʼanii natti kaʼan.<verse eid="JOB 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11"/>Waaqnis dabarsee hamootatti na kenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:11">harka jalʼootaa keessas na buuse.<verse eid="JOB 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12"/>Ani nagaan jiraachaan ture; inni garuu na burkuteesse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">morma na qabee na caccabse.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:12">Xiyyeeffannaa isaas na godhate;<verse eid="JOB 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13"/>loltoonni isaa warri xiyyaan lolan na marsu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:13">Inni gara laafina malee kalee koo waraanee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:13">hadhooftuu koo illee lafatti gad jigse.<verse eid="JOB 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14"/>Inni ammumaa amma na caccabsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:14">akkuma loltuu tokkootti natti fiiga.<verse eid="JOB 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15"/>“Ani gogaa kootti uffata gaddaa hodhadheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:15">gaanfa koos biyyoo keessatti awwaaleera.<verse eid="JOB 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16"/>Fuulli koo booʼichaan diimateera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:16">dukkanni limixiinis ija koo irra buʼeera.<verse eid="JOB 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17"/>Taʼus harki koo yakka tokko illee hin hojjenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:17">kadhannaan koos qulqulluu dha.<verse eid="JOB 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18"/>“Yaa lafa, ati dhiiga koo hin dhoksin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:18">akka iyyi koo iddoo boqonnaa argatus hin godhin!<verse eid="JOB 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19"/>Amma iyyuu dhuga baʼaan koo samii irra jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:19">abukaattoon koos ol gubbaa jira.<verse eid="JOB 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20"/>Michoonni koo na tuffatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:20">iji koos imimmaan gara Waaqaatti facaasa;<verse eid="JOB 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21"/>akkuma namni michuu isaatiif kadhatu sana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:21">utuu namni Waaqa kadhatu namaaf jiraatee!<verse eid="JOB 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22"/>“Waggoota xinnoo booddee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:22">ani gara deemanii deebiʼuun hin jirre nan deema.<verse eid="JOB 16:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1"/>Hafuurri koo dadhabeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:1">barri koo gabaabbateera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:1">awwaallis naa qopheeffameera.<verse eid="JOB 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2"/>Dhugumaan qoostonni na marsaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:2">iji koos hojii isaanii isa hamaa sana hubatee ilaala.<verse eid="JOB 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3"/>“Yaa Waaqi, qabsiisa naa taʼi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:3">si malee eenyutu wabii naa taʼa?<verse eid="JOB 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4"/>Akka isaan waa hin hubanneef ati sammuu isaanii cufteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:4">kanaafuu ati akka isaan moʼatan hin gootu.<verse eid="JOB 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5"/>Yoo namni tokko faayidaa argachuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:5">michuu isaa maqaa balleesse, iji ijoollee isaa ni jaama.<verse eid="JOB 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6"/>“Waaqni nama hunda biratti nama kolfaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:6">nama namni fuula isaatti tufu na godheera.<verse eid="JOB 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7"/>Iji koo sababii gaddaatiif arguu dhabe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:7">dhagni koo guutuunis akkuma gaaddidduu ti.<verse eid="JOB 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8"/>Qajeeltonni waan kanaan ni rifatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:8">namni balleessaa hin qabnes warra Waaqatti hin bulle irratti kaʼa.<verse eid="JOB 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9"/>Qajeelaan garuu karaa isaatti cima;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:9">warri harki isaanii qulqulluu taʼes jabaachaa deemu.<verse eid="JOB 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10"/>“Hundi keessan garuu mee deebiʼaa yaalaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:10">Ani isin keessaa nama ogeessa tokko illee hin argadhu.<verse eid="JOB 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11"/>Barri koo darbeera; karoorri koo fashalaaʼeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:11">hawwiin garaa koos akkasuma taʼeera.<verse eid="JOB 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12"/>Namoonni kunneen halkan guyyaatti geeddaraniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:12">utuma dukkana arganuus, ‘Ifni dhiʼaateera’ jedhu.<verse eid="JOB 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13"/>Yoo manni ani abdadhu awwaala qofa taʼe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:13">yoo ani dukkana keessatti siree koo afadhe,<verse eid="JOB 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14"/>yoo ani boolla qileetiin, ‘Ati abbaa koo ti;’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:14">raammoodhaan immoo, ‘Ati haadha koo ti;’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:14">yookaan ‘Obboleettii koo ti’ jedhe,<verse eid="JOB 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15"/>egaa abdiin koo eessa jira?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:15">Eenyutus abdii tokko illee naa arga?<verse eid="JOB 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16"/>Inni na wajjin awwaala buʼaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:16">Nus walumaan biyyoo seennaa?”<verse eid="JOB 17:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Bildaad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1"/>Bildaad Shuhaahichi akkana jedhee deebise:<verse eid="JOB 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2"/>“Isin haasaa kana yoom fixxu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:2">Mee qalbeeffadhaa; ergasii dubbachuu dandeenya.<verse eid="JOB 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3"/>Nu maaliif akka looniitti hedamna?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:3">Maaliifis fuula kee duratti akka gowwaatti ilaalamna?<verse eid="JOB 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4"/>Ati kan aariidhaan of ciccirtu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">lafti sababii keetiif duwwaatti haftii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">Yookaan kattaan iddoo isaatii ni buqqifamaa?<verse eid="JOB 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5"/>“Ibsaan nama hamaa ni dhaama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:5">arrabni ibidda isaa ifa hin kennu.<verse eid="JOB 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6"/>Ifni dunkaana isaa keessaa ni dukkanaaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:6">ibsaan isa bira jirus ni dhaama.<verse eid="JOB 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7"/>Jabinni tarkaanfii isaa ni dadhaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:7">malli isaas isuma kuffisa.<verse eid="JOB 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8"/>Miilli isaa kiyyoo keessa isa buusa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:8">inni boolla kiyyeeffame irra ni joora.<verse eid="JOB 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9"/>Kiyyoon kottee isaa qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:9">futtaasaanis jabeessee isa qaba.<verse eid="JOB 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10"/>Lafa irra funyoon isaaf dhokfameera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:10">karaa isaa irras kiyyoon kaaʼameera.<verse eid="JOB 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11"/>Naasuun karaa hundaan isa sodaachisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:11">faana isaa buʼees isa ariʼa.<verse eid="JOB 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12"/>Badiisni afaan itti banateera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:12">balaanis qophaaʼee jiguu isaa eeggata.<verse eid="JOB 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13"/>Gogaan isaa dhukkubaan nyaatamee dhuma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:13">ilmi duʼaa hangaftichi harkaa fi miilla isaa nyaata.<verse eid="JOB 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14"/>Inni dunkaana abdate keessaa buqqifamee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:14">gara mootii sodaatti geeffama.<verse eid="JOB 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15"/>Waan kan isaa hin taʼinis dunkaana isaa keessa jiraata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:15">dinyiin bobaʼus iddoo inni jiraatu irra faffacaʼa.<verse eid="JOB 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16"/>Jalaan hiddi isaa ni goga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:16">irraan immoo dameen isaa ni coollaga.<verse eid="JOB 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17"/>Yaadannoon isaa lafa irraa ni bada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:17">maqaan isaas lafa irraa ni dhabama.<verse eid="JOB 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18"/>Inni ifa keessaa gara dukkanaatti darbatama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:18">addunyaa irraas ni dhabama.<verse eid="JOB 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19"/>Inni saba isaa gidduutti ijoollee yookaan sanyii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:19">biyya duraan jiraate keessatti hambaa hin qabaatu.<verse eid="JOB 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20"/>Namoonni dhiʼaa waaʼee isaa dhagaʼanii rifatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:20">warri baʼaas sodaadhaan guutamu.<verse eid="JOB 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21"/>Iddoon jireenya nama hamaa, dhugumaan akkana taʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:21">iddoon nama Waaqa hin beeknees kanuma taʼa.”<verse eid="JOB 18:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1"/>Iyyoobis akkana jedhee deebise:<verse eid="JOB 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2"/>“Isin hamma yoomiitti na dhiphistanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:2">dubbiin na cabsitu?<verse eid="JOB 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3"/>Amma siʼa kudhan na arrabsitaniirtu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:3">qaanii malees na miitaniirtu.<verse eid="JOB 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4"/>Yoo ani dhugumaan karaa irraa goree jiraadhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:4">dogoggorri koo anuma wajjin jiraata.<verse eid="JOB 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5"/>Yoo isin dhugumaan anaa olitti of guddiftanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:5">na miidhuuf salphina kootti fayyadamtan,<verse eid="JOB 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6"/>akka Waaqni na miidhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:6">kiyyoo isaa illee natti xaxe beekaa.<verse eid="JOB 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7"/>“ ‘Ani miidhameera!’ jedhee iyyadhu illee deebii hin argadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:7">sagalee ol fudhadhee gargaarsaaf iyyus <optbreak/> murtiin qajeelaan hin jiru.<verse eid="JOB 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8"/>Akka ani hin dabarreef inni karaa koo cufeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:8">daandii koottis dukkana haguugeera.<verse eid="JOB 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9"/>Ulfina koo narraa mulqeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:9">mataa koo irraas gonfoo fuudheera.<verse eid="JOB 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10"/>Inni hamma ani badutti gama hundaan na diiga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:10">abdii koo illee akkuma mukaa buqqisa.<verse eid="JOB 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11"/>Dheekkamsi isaa natti bobaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:11">akkuma diina isaattis na heda.<verse eid="JOB 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12"/>Loltoonni isaa humnaan dhufanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:12">naannoo kootti daʼannaa ijaarratan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:12">dunkaana koos ni marsan.<verse eid="JOB 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13"/>“Inni obboloota koo narraa fageesseera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:13">michoonni koos keessummaa natti taʼan.<verse eid="JOB 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14"/>Firoonni koo na dhiisaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:14">michuuwwan koos na dagataniiru.<verse eid="JOB 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15"/>Keessumoonni mana koo jiranii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:15">xomboreewwan koo akka alagaatti na ilaalan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:15">akka nama ormaattis na hedan.<verse eid="JOB 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16"/>Hojjetaa koo nan waama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:16">afaan kootiinis isa nan kadhadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:16">inni garuu na jalaa hin owwaatu.<verse eid="JOB 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17"/>Hafuurri koo niitii kootti illee jibbisiisaa dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:17">ani obboloota koottis xiraaʼaa dha.<verse eid="JOB 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18"/>Ijoolleen xixinnoon iyyuu na tuffatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:18">yommuu ani kaʼus natti qoosu.<verse eid="JOB 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19"/>Michoonni koo kanneen walitti dhiʼaannu hundi na balfan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:19">warri ani jaalladhus natti garagalan.<verse eid="JOB 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20"/>Ani gogaa fi lafeedha malee homaa miti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:20">gogaan ilkaanii qofti naaf hafeen jalaa baʼe.<verse eid="JOB 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21"/>“Garaa naa laafaa, yaa michoota koo garaa naa laafaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:21">harki Waaqaa na dhaʼeeraatii.<verse eid="JOB 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22"/>Isin maaliif akkuma Waaqni na ariʼu sana na ariitu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:22">Amma illee foon koo isin hin geenyee?<verse eid="JOB 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23"/>“Maaloo utuu dubbiin koo barreeffamee jiraatee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:23">Utuu kitaaba keessatti barreeffamee!<verse eid="JOB 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24"/>Utuu sibiilaan kattaa irratti barreeffamee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:24">yookaan bara baraan dhagaa irratti qirixamee jiraatee!<verse eid="JOB 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25"/>Ani akka furiin koo jiraataa taʼe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:25">akka inni dhuma irratti lafa irra dhaabatus nan beeka.<verse eid="JOB 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26"/>Erga gogaan koo badee booddee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:26">ani amma iyyuu foon kootiin Waaqa nan arga;<verse eid="JOB 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27"/>ani mataan koo isa nan arga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">utuu nama biraa hin taʼin anuu ija kootiin isa nan arga.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">Onneen koo akkam na keessatti gaggabdi!<verse eid="JOB 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28"/>“Yoo isin, ‘Sababii hiddi rakkina sanaa isa keessa jiruuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:28">nu akkamitti isa ariina?’ jettan,<verse eid="JOB 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29"/>sababii dheekkamsi goraadeedhaan adabamuu fiduuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">isin mataan keessan goraadee sodaachuu qabdu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">kunis akka isin akka murtiin jiru beektaniif.”<verse eid="JOB 19:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Zoofaari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1"/>Zoofaari Naaʼimaatichi akkana jedhee deebise:<verse eid="JOB 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2"/>“Waan ani akka malee jeeqameef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:2">yaadni koo akka ani deebii kennu na kakaasa.<verse eid="JOB 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3"/>Ani dheekkamsa na qaanessu dhagaʼaan jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:3">qalbiin koos akka ani deebii kennu na kakaasa.<verse eid="JOB 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4"/>“Ati erga namni lafa irra kaaʼamee bara duriitii jalqabee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:4">wanni kun akkam akka ture ni beekta mitii?<verse eid="JOB 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5"/>Burraaquun jalʼootaa yeroo gabaabaaf tura;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:5">gammachuun warra Waaqaaf hin bullees akkuma liphsuu ijaa ti.<verse eid="JOB 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6"/>Of tuulummaan isaa samiiwwan gaʼee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:6">mataan isaa duumessawwan tuqus,<verse eid="JOB 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7"/>inni akkuma awwaaraa bara baraan bada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:7">warri duraan isa arganis, ‘Inni eessa jira?’ jedhu.<verse eid="JOB 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8"/>Inni akkuma abjuu fiigee bada; deebiʼees hin argamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:8">akkuma mulʼata halkaniis dafee dhabama.<verse eid="JOB 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9"/>Iji isaa argee ture deebiʼee isa hin argu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:9">iddoon isaas siʼachi isa hin ilaalu.<verse eid="JOB 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10"/>Ijoolleen isaa hiyyeeyyiif beenyaa baasu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:10">harki isaas qabeenya inni saame deebisee kennuu qaba.<verse eid="JOB 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11"/>Jabinni dargaggummaa kan lafee isaa keessa guute sun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:11">isa wajjin biyyoo keessa ciisa.<verse eid="JOB 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12"/>“Hamminni afaan isaa keessatti miʼaawee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:12">inni arraba isaa jala dhokfatu iyyuu,<verse eid="JOB 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13"/>inni afaanii baafatee gatuu jibbee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:13">afaanuma ofii isaa keessa turfatu iyyuu,<verse eid="JOB 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14"/>nyaanni isaa garaa isaa keessatti dhangaggaaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:14">isa keessattis hadhaa bofaa taʼa.<verse eid="JOB 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15"/>Inni qabeenya liqimse sana ni tufa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:15">Waaqnis akka garaan isaa waan sana diddigu ni godha.<verse eid="JOB 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16"/>Inni summii bofaa xuuxa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:16">arrabni buutiis isa ajjeesa.<verse eid="JOB 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17"/>Inni laga yaaʼu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:17">burqaa dammaatii fi dhadhaa hin argu.<verse eid="JOB 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18"/>Inni waan itti dadhabe utuu hin nyaatin deebisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:18">buʼaa daldala isaa irraa argatettis hin gammadu.<verse eid="JOB 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19"/>Inni hiyyeeyyii hacuucee harka duwwaa hambiseeraatii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:19">mana ofii hin ijaarinis humnaan fudhateera.<verse eid="JOB 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20"/>“Hawwii isaa hamaa sana irraa boqonnaa hin argatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:20">inni qabeenya isaatiin of oolchuu hin dandaʼu.<verse eid="JOB 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21"/>Wanni inni nyaatu tokko iyyuu hin hafuuf;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:21">badhaadhummaan isaas itti fufee hin jiraatu.<verse eid="JOB 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22"/>Utuma inni waan hunda qabuu rakkinni isatti dhufa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:22">dhiphinni cimaanis isa qabata.<verse eid="JOB 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23"/>Yeroo inni garaa isaa guutatutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:23">Waaqni dheekkamsa isaa sodaachisaa sana itti erga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:23">dhaʼicha isaa illee itti roobsa.<verse eid="JOB 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24"/>Inni miʼa lolaa sibiilaa baqatu illee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:24">xiyya naasiitu isa waraana.<verse eid="JOB 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25"/>Dudga isaa keessaa xiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:25">tiruu isaa keessaa immoo fiixee calaqqisu buqqisa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:25">Sodaan guddaan isa qabata;<verse eid="JOB 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26"/>dukkanni limixiinis riphee qabeenya isaa eeggata.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:26">Ibiddi namni tokko iyyuu hin afarsin gubee isa fixa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:26">waan dunkaana isaa keessatti hafes ni barbadeessa.<verse eid="JOB 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27"/>Samiiwwan balleessaa isaa saaxilu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:27">laftis isatti kaati.<verse eid="JOB 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28"/>Guyyaa dheekkamsa Waaqaatti lolaan mana isaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:28">bishaan yaaʼus miʼa isaa fudhatee deema.<verse eid="JOB 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29"/>Carraan Waaqni cubbamootaaf kennu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:29">dhaalli Waaqni isaaniif qoodes kanuma.”<verse eid="JOB 20:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1"/>Iyyoob akkana jedhee deebise:<verse eid="JOB 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2"/>“Dubbii koo qalbeeffadhaa dhaggeeffadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:2">kun waan isin ittiin na jajjabeessitan haa taʼu.<verse eid="JOB 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3"/>Yeroo ani dubbadhu naa obsaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:3">erga ani dubbadhee booddee isin natti qoosuu dandeessu.<verse eid="JOB 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4"/>“Dhugumaan kan ani komadhu namaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:4">Ani maaliif obsa hin dhabne ree?<verse eid="JOB 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5"/>Na ilaalaatii dinqisiifadhaa; harka keessanis</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:5">afaan keessan irra kaaʼadhaa.<verse eid="JOB 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6"/>Ani yommuu waan kana yaadu nan sodaadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:6">hollannaanis na qabata.<verse eid="JOB 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7"/>Hamoonni maaliif itti fufanii lubbuun jiraatu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:7">Maaliif dulloomanii humnas argachaa deemu?<verse eid="JOB 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8"/>Ijoolleen isaanii naannoo isaaniitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:8">sanyiin isaaniis fuula isaanii duratti jabaatanii dhaabatu.<verse eid="JOB 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9"/>Manni isaanii nagaa dha; waan sodaatu illee hin qabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:9">uleen Waaqaas isaan hin tuqxu.<verse eid="JOB 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10"/>Kormi isaanii dhalchuu hin dadhabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:10">saawwan isaanii ni dhalu; hin gatatanis.<verse eid="JOB 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11"/>Isaan ijoollee isaanii akkuma bushaayeetti bobbaasu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:11">daaʼimman isaanii immoo ni burraaqu.<verse eid="JOB 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12"/>Dibbee fi kiraaraan sirbu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:12">sagalee ululleetiinis ni gammadu.<verse eid="JOB 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13"/>Isaan bara isaanii badhaadhummaadhaan fixatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:13">nagaadhaanis ni awwaalamu.<verse eid="JOB 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14"/>Taʼu illee isaan Waaqaan akkana jedhu; ‘Nu dhiisi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:14">Nu karaa kee beekuuf fedhii hin qabnu.<verse eid="JOB 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15"/>Akka nu isa tajaajilluuf Waaqni waan Hunda Dandaʼu eenyu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:15">Nu isa kadhannee maal arganna?’<verse eid="JOB 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16"/>Badhaadhummaan isaanii garuu isaan harka hin jiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:16">kanaafuu ani gorsa hamootaa irraa nan fagaadha.<verse eid="JOB 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17"/>“Garuu ibsaan hamootaa yoom iyyuu ni dhaamaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">Balaan yoom iyyuu isaanitti dhufaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">Waaqnis dheekkamsa isaatiin badiisa isaanitti fidaa?<verse eid="JOB 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18"/>Isaan akkuma cidii fuula qilleensaa duraa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:18">akkuma habaqii bubbeen hamaan fudhatee deemuu ti.<verse eid="JOB 21:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19"/>Isin, ‘Waaqni balleessaa nama tokkoo ilmaan isaatiif kuusa’ jettu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">Akka inni waan kana beekuuf Waaqni namichuma mataa isaatiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">gatii isaa haa kennu!<verse eid="JOB 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20"/>Iji isaa badiisa isaa haa argu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:20">inni xoofoo dheekkamsa Waaqa Waan Hunda Dandaʼuu haa dhugu.<verse eid="JOB 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21"/>Inni yeroo jiʼi isaaf qoodame dhumutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:21">waaʼee maatii isaa kan dhiisee biraa deemu sanaa <optbreak/> dhimma maalii qabaata?<verse eid="JOB 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22"/>“Namni tokko iyyuu Waaqa beekumsa barsiisuu dandaʼaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:22">Waaqni ol aantotatti iyyuu ni muraatii.<verse eid="JOB 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23"/>Namni tokko utuma itti tolee nagaan jiraatuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:23">utuma humna guutuu qabuu,<verse eid="JOB 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24"/>utuma dhagni isaa gabbatee jiruu, utuma lafeen isaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:24">dhukaan guutamee jiruu ni duʼa.<verse eid="JOB 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25"/>Namni biraa immoo utuu gammachuu tokko illee hin argin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:25">jireenya hadhaaʼaa jiraachaa duʼa.<verse eid="JOB 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26"/>Isaan biyyoo keessa wal bira ciciisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:26">lachan isaaniittuu raammoon ni tuutaʼa.<verse eid="JOB 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27"/>“Ani yaada keessanii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:27">mala isin ittiin na miidhuu barbaaddan nan beeka.<verse eid="JOB 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28"/>Isin, ‘Manni namicha guddaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:28">dunkaanni namoonni hamoon keessa jiraatan amma eessa jira?’ jettu.<verse eid="JOB 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29"/>Isin namoota karaa deeman hin gaafannee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:29">Waan isaan jedhanis hin qalbeeffannee?<verse eid="JOB 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30"/>Akka namni hamaan guyyaa balaa oolfamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:30">akka inni guyyaa dheekkamsaa illee baraaramu hin qalbeeffannee?<verse eid="JOB 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31"/>Namni fuuluma isaa dura dhaabatee hojii isaa itti himu eenyu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:31">Namni gatii waan inni hojjetee baasuuf eenyu?<verse eid="JOB 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32"/>Inni gara awwaalaatti geeffama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:32">awwaalli isaas ni eegama.<verse eid="JOB 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33"/>Biyyoon sulula keessaa isatti miʼaawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">namoonni hundi isa duukaa buʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">namoonni akka malee baayʼeenis fuula isaa dura deemu.<verse eid="JOB 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34"/>“Yoos isin akkamiin waan faayidaa hin qabneen <optbreak/> na jajjabeessuu dandeessu ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:34">Deebiin keessanis soba qofa!”<verse eid="JOB 21:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Eliifaaz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1"/>Eliifaaz Teemaanichi akkana jedhee deebise:<verse eid="JOB 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2"/>“Namni Waaqa fayyaduu dandaʼaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:2">Namni ogeessi iyyuu maal isa fayyada?<verse eid="JOB 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3"/>Yoo ati nama qajeelaa taate wanni kun Waaqa Waan Hunda Dandaʼuuf <optbreak/> gammachuu maalii kenna?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:3">Yoo karaan kee hirʼina qabaachuu baates inni buʼaa maalii argata?<verse eid="JOB 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4"/>“Wanni Waaqni sitti dheekkamee murtiitti si dhiʼeessuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:4">waan ati isa sodaattuufii?<verse eid="JOB 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5"/>Hamminni kee guddaa dha mitii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:5">Cubbuun kees dhuma hin qabu mitii?<verse eid="JOB 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6"/>Ati sababii malee obboloota kee irraa qabdii fudhatteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:6">namoota irraa uffata baaftee qullaa isaan hambifteerta.<verse eid="JOB 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7"/>Warra dadhaban bishaan hin obaafne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:7">kanneen beelaʼanis nyaata dhowwatteerta;<verse eid="JOB 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8"/>namni humna qabu biyya qabaata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:8">kan ulfina qabus keessa jiraata.<verse eid="JOB 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9"/>Ati dubartoota dhirsoonni irraa duʼan harka duwwaa gad dhiifte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:9">irree ijoollee abbaa hin qabnees ni cabsite.<verse eid="JOB 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10"/>Kanaafuu kiyyoon si marseera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:10">sodaan tasaas si qabateera.<verse eid="JOB 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11"/>Akka ati hin argineef ifni kee dukkanaaʼeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:11">lolaan bishaaniis sirra garagala.<verse eid="JOB 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12"/>“Waaqni samii keessa ol fagoo jiraata mitii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:12">Inni urjiiwwan ol fagoo jiran illee hammam akka ol fagaatan of jalatti gad ilaala!<verse eid="JOB 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13"/>Ati garuu akkana jetta; ‘Waaqni maal beeka?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:13">Inni dukkana akkasii keessatti murtii kennaa?<verse eid="JOB 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14"/>Yommuu inni bantii samii irra deemu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:14">akka inni nu hin argineef duumessi gobbuun isa haguuga.’<verse eid="JOB 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15"/>Ati daandii durii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:15">kan namoonni hamoon irra deeman duukaa buutaa?<verse eid="JOB 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16"/>Isaan utuu yeroon isaanii hin gaʼin fudhataman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:16">hundeen isaanis lolaadhaan haxaaʼame.<verse eid="JOB 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17"/>Isaanis Waaqaan, ‘Nu dhiisi! Waaqni Waan Hunda Dandaʼu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:17">maal nu gochuu dandaʼa?’ jedhan.<verse eid="JOB 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18"/>Garuu kan mana isaanii waan gaariin guute isuma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:18">kanaafuu ani gorsa hamootaa irraa nan fagaadha.<verse eid="JOB 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19"/>Qajeelonnis badiisa isaanii arganii ni gammadu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:19">warri balleessaa hin qabnes akkana jedhanii isaanitti qoosu;<verse eid="JOB 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20"/>‘Dhugumaan amajaajonni keenya balleeffamaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:20">qabeenya isaaniis ibiddi barbadeesseera.’<verse eid="JOB 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21"/>“Waaqaan walii gali; isa wajjinis nagaan jiraadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:21">haala kanaanis wanni gaariin siif dhufa.<verse eid="JOB 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22"/>Afaan isaatii qajeelfama fudhadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:22">dubbii isaa illee garaatti qabadhu.<verse eid="JOB 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23"/>Yoo gara Waaqa Waan Hunda Dandaʼuutti deebite, <optbreak/> ati ni haaromfamta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:23">yoo dunkaana kee keessaa hammina balleessitee<verse eid="JOB 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24"/>warqee kee biyyoo keessa buufte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:24">yoo warqee Oofiirii immoo dhagaa keessatti gatte,<verse eid="JOB 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25"/>yoos Waaqni Waan Hunda Dandaʼu warqee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:25">meetii filatamaas siif taʼa.<verse eid="JOB 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26"/>Ati yeroo sanatti Waaqa Waan Hunda Dandaʼutti ni gammadda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:26">fuula kees gara Waaqaatti ol qabatta.<verse eid="JOB 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27"/>Ati isa kadhatta; inni si dhagaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:27">ati immoo wareega kee ni baafatta.<verse eid="JOB 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28"/>Wanni ati murteessite ni taʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:28">ifnis karaa kee irratti ni ifa.<verse eid="JOB 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29"/>Yeroo namoonni gad qabamanitti ati immoo, ‘Ol isaan qabi!’ jetta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:29">innis warra gad qabaman ni baraara.<verse eid="JOB 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30"/>Inni nama balleessaa qabu illee ni oolcha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:30">ati qulqullummaa harka keetiitiin furamta.”<verse eid="JOB 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1"/>Iyyoob akkana jedhee deebise:<verse eid="JOB 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2"/>“Harʼa iyyuu guungummiin koo hadhaaʼaa dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:2">yoo ani akkam aade iyyuu harki isaa natti ulfaateera.<verse eid="JOB 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3"/>Ani utuun iddoo itti isa argadhu beekee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:3">utuu iddoo inni jiraatu illee dhaquu dandaʼee!<verse eid="JOB 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4"/>Silaa dhimma koo fuula isaa duratti dhiʼeeffadhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:4">afaan koo falmiin guuttadha ture.<verse eid="JOB 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5"/>Waan inni naa deebisu nan beekan ture;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:5">waan inni naan jedhus nan hubadhan ture.<verse eid="JOB 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6"/>Inni humna isaa guddaa sanaan anaan mormaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:6">Lakki, na dhaggeeffata malee.<verse eid="JOB 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7"/>Namni qajeelaan achuma fuula isaa duratti dhimma isaa ni dhiʼeeffata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:7">anis isa natti muru jalaa bara baraan nan baʼa.<verse eid="JOB 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8"/>“Garuu yoo ani gara baʼa biiftuu deeme, inni achi hin jiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:8">ani yoo gara dhiʼaa dhaqes achitti isa hin argadhu.<verse eid="JOB 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9"/>Yommuu inni kaabatti hojii irra jirutti ani isa hin argu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:9">yommuu inni gara kibbaatti deebiʼuttis</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:9">ani hamma libsuu ijaa isa arguu hin dandaʼu.<verse eid="JOB 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10"/>Inni garuu karaa ani baʼu ni beeka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:10">yommuu inni na qoruttis ani akka warqee taʼee nan mulʼadha.<verse eid="JOB 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11"/>Miilli koo tarkaanfii isaatti dhiʼaatee duukaa buʼeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:11">ani utuun irraa hin gorin karaa isaa eegeera.<verse eid="JOB 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12"/>Ani ajaja afaan isaa irraa hin fagaanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:12">nyaata guyyaa guyyaa caalaas dubbii afaan isaa nan jaalladha.<verse eid="JOB 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13"/>“Inni garuu of dandaʼee kophaa isaa dhaabata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:13">kan isaan mormuu dandaʼu eenyu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:13">Inni waanuma jaallatu hojjeta.<verse eid="JOB 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14"/>Inni waan natti mure ni raawwata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:14">amma illee karoora akkanaa hedduu yaada isaa keessaa qaba.<verse eid="JOB 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15"/>Wanni ani fuula isaa duratti naʼuufis kanuma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:15">ani yommuun waan kana hunda yaadutti isa nan sodaadha.<verse eid="JOB 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16"/>Waaqni garaa koo ni raase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:16">Waaqni Waan Hunda Dandaʼu na sodaachise.<verse eid="JOB 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17"/>Haa taʼu malee dukkanni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:17">dukkanni limixiin fuula koo haguugu iyyuu na hin barbadeessine.<verse eid="JOB 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1"/>“Waaqni Waan Hunda Dandaʼu sun maaliif yeroo murtii hin murteessine?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:1">Warri isa beekan maaliif akkasumaan guyyoota isaa hin argine?<verse eid="JOB 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2"/>Namoonni dhagaa daarii ni dhiibu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:2">bushaayee hataniis ni bobbaasu.<verse eid="JOB 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3"/>Isaan harree ijoollee abbaa hin qabnee ooffatanii deemu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:3">sangaa haadha hiyyeessaa qabdii fudhatu.<verse eid="JOB 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4"/>Rakkataa karaa irraa balleessu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:4">hiyyeeyyiin biyyaa hundis isaan jalaa dhokatu.<verse eid="JOB 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5"/>Hiyyeeyyiin akkuma harree diidaa kan gammoojjii keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:5">nyaata barbaacha asii fi achi jooru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:5">gammoojjii sana keessaas ijoollee isaaniitiif nyaata kenna.<verse eid="JOB 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6"/>Isaan dirree irratti okaa walitti qabatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:6">iddoo dhaabaa wayinii nama hamaa irraas qarmii funaannatu.<verse eid="JOB 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7"/>Uffata dhabanii halkan qullaa bulu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:7">waan dhaamocha keessatti uffatan tokko illee hin qaban.<verse eid="JOB 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8"/>Isaan bokkaa tulluutiin tortoraniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:8">waan itti daʼatan illee dhabanii kattaa hammatu.<verse eid="JOB 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9"/>Mucaan abbaa hin qabne harma irraa butameera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:9">daaʼimni hiyyeessaa qabdii kennameera.<verse eid="JOB 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10"/>Isaan uffata dhabanii qullaa deemu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:10">bissii baatu; garuu ni beelaʼu.<verse eid="JOB 24:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11"/>Isaan dhagaa gidduutti zayitii ejersaa baasu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:11">wayinii cuunfu; garuu ni dheebotu.<verse eid="JOB 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12"/>Aaduun warra duʼuutti jiranii magaalaa keessaa ni dhagaʼama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">lubbuun warra madaaʼaniis gargaarsa barbaacha iyyiti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">Waaqni garuu balleessaa tokko iyyuu isaanitti hin lakkaaʼu.<verse eid="JOB 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13"/>“Warri ifatti fincilan kanneen daandii isaa hin beekne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:13">yookaan daandii ifaa irra hin jiraanne jiru.<verse eid="JOB 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14"/>Yommuu aduun dhiitu, namni nama ajjeesu ni kaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">innis hiyyeeyyii fi rakkattoota ni ajjeesa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">halkan immoo akkuma hattuu taʼa.<verse eid="JOB 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15"/>Iji ejjaan dimimmisa eeggata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:15">innis, ‘Iji na argu hin jirtu’ jedha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:15">fuula isaas ni dhokfata.<verse eid="JOB 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16"/>Namoonni dukkana keessa mana cabsanii seenu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:16">guyyaa garuu ofitti cufanii oolu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:16">isaan ifa hin beekan.<verse eid="JOB 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17"/>Hunda isaaniitiif, dukkanni guddaan barii isaanii ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:17">isaan sodaa dukkana guddaatti michoomu.<verse eid="JOB 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18"/>“Taʼus isaan hoomacha bishaan gubbaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">akka namni tokko iyyuu gara iddoo dhaabaa wayinii hin dhaqneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">qoodni lafa isaanii abaarameera.<verse eid="JOB 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19"/>Akkuma hoʼii fi hoongeen cabbii baqee xuuxee fixu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:19">awwaalli namoota cubbuu hojjetan ni butata.<verse eid="JOB 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20"/>Gadameessi isaan irraanfata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">raammoonnis itti duuddee isaan nyaatti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:20">namoonni hamoon akkuma mukaa ni caccabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">siʼachis hin yaadataman.<verse eid="JOB 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21"/>Isaan dubartii dhabduu ni saamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:21">haadha hiyyeessaatiif illee garaa hin laafan.<verse eid="JOB 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22"/>Waaqni garuu humna isaatiin jajjaboota alatti harkisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:22">isaan ol kaʼu; garuu wabii jireenyaa hin qaban.<verse eid="JOB 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23"/>Inni akka isaan waan nagaan jiraatan seʼaniif ittuma dhiisuu dandaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:23">iji isaa garuu karaa isaanii ni toʼata.<verse eid="JOB 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24"/>Isaan yeroo xinnoof mataa ol qabatu; ergasii immoo ni badu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:24">gad deebifamaniis akkuma warra kaanii walitti qabamu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:24">akkuma mataa midhaaniis ni muramu.<verse eid="JOB 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25"/>“Yoo kun akkas taʼuu baate</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:25">eenyutu sobduu na godhee dubbii koo busheessa?”<verse eid="JOB 24:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Bildaad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1"/>Bildaad Shuhaahichi akkana jedhee deebise:<verse eid="JOB 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2"/>“Mootummaa fi sodaatamuun kan Waaqaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:2">inni samiiwwan ol fagoo keessatti nagaa buusa.<verse eid="JOB 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3"/>Loltoonni isaa lakkaaʼamuu dandaʼuu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:3">Ifni isaa eenyu irratti utuu hin baʼin hafa?<verse eid="JOB 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4"/>Yoos namni akkamitti fuula Waaqaa duratti qajeelaa taʼuu dandaʼa ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:4">Namni dubartii irraa dhalate akkamitti qulqulluu taʼuu dandaʼa?<verse eid="JOB 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5"/>Yoo jiʼi illee fuula isaa duratti hin ifne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:5">yoo urjiiwwanis ija isaa duratti qulqulluu taʼuu baatan,<verse eid="JOB 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6"/>namni raammoo foonii taʼe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:6">ilmi namaa kan raammoo taʼe sun hammam kanaa gad haa taʼu ree!”<verse eid="JOB 25:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1"/>Iyyoob akkana jedhee deebise:<verse eid="JOB 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2"/>“Ati nama humna hin qabne hammam gargaarte!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:2">Irree laafes hammam jajjabeessite!<verse eid="JOB 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3"/>Nama ogummaa hin qabneef gorsa akkamii kennite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:3">Beekumsa guddaa akkamiis argisiifte!<verse eid="JOB 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4"/>Akka ati dubbii kana dubbattuuf eenyutu si gargaare?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:4">Hafuura eenyuutu afaan kee keessaa dubbate?<verse eid="JOB 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5"/>“Warri duʼan, warri bishaanii gadiitii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:5">kanneen bishaan keessa jiraatan hundii ni hollatu.<verse eid="JOB 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6"/>Duuti fuula Waaqaa duratti qullaa jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:6">badiisnis waan isa dhoksu hin qabu.<verse eid="JOB 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7"/>Waaqni iddoo duwwaa irra samii kaabaa diriirsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:7">lafas iddoo duwwaa irratti rarraasa.<verse eid="JOB 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8"/>Inni duumessa isaatiin bishaanota hidhee qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:8">duumessi sunis bishaanota jalatti hin dhoʼu.<verse eid="JOB 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9"/>Inni duumessoota isaa itti uffisuudhaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:9">fuula jiʼaa ni haguuga.<verse eid="JOB 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10"/>Inni fuula bishaanotaa irratti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:10">ifaa fi dukkana gidduu daarii dhaabe.<verse eid="JOB 26:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11"/>Utubaawwan samii ni hollatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:11">dheekkamsa isaatiinis ni rifatu.<verse eid="JOB 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12"/>Inni humna isaatiin galaana ni raasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:12">ogummaa isaatiinis Raʼaabin ni ciccira.<verse eid="JOB 26:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13"/>Hafuura baafatuun samiiwwan qulqulleesse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:13">harki isaas bofa shawwisaa waraane.<verse eid="JOB 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14"/>Wantoonni kunneen hojii isaa keessaa qarqaruma qofa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">hasaasni nu waaʼee isaa dhageenyu hammam xinnaa dha!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">Yoos kakawwee humna isaa eenyutu hubachuu dandaʼa ree?”<verse eid="JOB 26:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1"/>Iyyoob haasaa isaa itti fufee akkana jedhe:<verse eid="JOB 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2"/>“Dhugaa Waaqa jiraataa murtii qajeelaa na dhowwate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:2">Waaqa Waan Hunda Dandaʼu kan lubbuu koo hadheesse sanaa,<verse eid="JOB 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3"/>hamma lubbuun na keessa jirtutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:3">hamma hafuurri Waaqaa funyaan koo keessa jirutti,<verse eid="JOB 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4"/>afaan koo hammina hin dubbatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:4">arrabni koos nama hin gowwoomsu.<verse eid="JOB 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5"/>Isin qajeeltota jechuu, Waaqni ana irraa haa fagaatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:5">ani hamman duʼutti amanamummaa koo hin dhiisu.<verse eid="JOB 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6"/>Qajeelummaa koo jabeessee nan qabadha; gadis hin dhiisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:6">bara jireenya kootii guutuu qalbiin koo na hin komattu.<verse eid="JOB 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7"/>“Diinni koo akka nama hamaa, mormituun koo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:7">akka nama jalʼaa haa taʼu!<verse eid="JOB 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8"/>Yommuu Waaqni lubbuu isaa isa irraa fudhatee isa balleessutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:8">namni Waaqaaf hin bulle abdii maalii qaba?<verse eid="JOB 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9"/>Yeroo rakkinni isatti dhufutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:9">Waaqni iyya isaa ni dhagaʼaa?<verse eid="JOB 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10"/>Inni Waaqa Waan Hunda Dandaʼutti ni gammadaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:10">Yeroo hundas Waaqa waammataa?<verse eid="JOB 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11"/>“Ani waaʼee harka Waaqaa isin nan barsiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:11">waan Waaqa Waan Hunda Dandaʼu bira jirus isin hin dhoksu.<verse eid="JOB 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12"/>Hundi keessan waan kana argitaniirtu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:12">yoos haasaan faayidaa hin qabne kun maali?<verse eid="JOB 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13"/>“Carraan Waaqni nama hamaaf qoode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:13">dhaalli namni jalʼaan Waaqa Waan Hunda Dandaʼu irraa argatu kana:<verse eid="JOB 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14"/>Ijoolleen isaa akka malee baayʼatan iyyuu goraadeetu isaan eeggata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:14">sanyiin isaas waan nyaatee quufu hin qabaatu.<verse eid="JOB 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15"/>Hambaa isaa dhaʼichatu awwaala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:15">niitonni isaaniis hin booʼaniif.<verse eid="JOB 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16"/>Inni meetii akkuma biyyootti tuullatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:16">uffata immoo akkuma supheetti kuufatu illee,<verse eid="JOB 27:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17"/>waan inni kuufate nama qajeelaatu uffata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:17">meetii isaa illee nama balleessaa hin qabnetu qooddata.<verse eid="JOB 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18"/>Manni inni ijaaru akkuma mana dholdholee ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:18">akkuma daasii eegduun ijaaruu ti.<verse eid="JOB 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19"/>Inni utuma qabeenya qabuu dhaqee ciisa; garuu itti hin deebiʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:19">yeroo inni ija banatutti, qabeenyi isaa hundi hin jiru.<verse eid="JOB 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20"/>Sodaan akkuma lolaa isa irra garagala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:20">bubbeen hamaan immoo halkaniin isa fudhatee sokka.<verse eid="JOB 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21"/>Bubbeen baʼa biiftuu isa fudhata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:21">innis hin argamu; bubbeen sunis lafa inni jiru irraa isa haxaaʼa.<verse eid="JOB 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22"/>Inni humna bubbee jalaa baʼuuf jedhee baqata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:22">bubbeen sunis gara laafina tokko malee itti of darbata.<verse eid="JOB 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23"/>Harka isaa dhadhaʼee itti qoosa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:23">afuufees iddoo isaatii isa balleessa.”<verse eid="JOB 27:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1"/>Dhugumaan iddoon meetiin keessaa qotamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:1">lafti warqeen itti baafamee qulqulleeffamu jira.<verse eid="JOB 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2"/>Sibiilli lafa keessaa baafama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:2">sibiilli diimaan immoo dhagaa albuudaa irraa baqfama.<verse eid="JOB 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3"/>Namni hamma dhuma dukkanaatti deema;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:3">moggaa akka malee fagoo dhaqees,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:3">dukkana hamaa keessa dhagaa albuudaa barbaada.<verse eid="JOB 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4"/>Inni lafa namoonni jiraatan irraa fagaatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">iddoo miilli namaa ejjetee hin beeknetti boolla qota;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">namoota irraa fagaatee ni rarraʼa; asii fi achis ni raafama.<verse eid="JOB 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5"/>Lafa irraa garuu nyaatatu argama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:5">jala isheetiin immoo akka waan ibidda taateetti geeddaramti;<verse eid="JOB 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6"/>dhagaan isaa burqaa sanpeerii ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:6">biyyoon isaas warqee qaba.<verse eid="JOB 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7"/>Allaattiin tokko iyyuu karaa dhokfame sana hin beeku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:7">iji culullees karaa sana hin argine.<verse eid="JOB 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8"/>Bineensonni sodaachisoon irra hin ejjenne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:8">leencis karaa sana hin darbine.<verse eid="JOB 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9"/>Harki namaa dhagaa jabaa cabsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:9">hundee tulluuwwanii immoo ni gaggaragalcha.<verse eid="JOB 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10"/>Inni kattaa keessaan karaa baasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:10">iji isaas waan gatii guddaa hunda arga.<verse eid="JOB 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11"/>Madda lageenii ni sakattaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:11">waan dhokfames ifatti ni baasa.<verse eid="JOB 28:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12"/>Ogummaan garuu eessaa argamti?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:12">Hubannaanis eessa jiraata?<verse eid="JOB 28:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13"/>Namni gatii isaa hin beeku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:13">inni biyya jiraattotaa keessatti hin argamu.<verse eid="JOB 28:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14"/>Tujubni, “Inni na keessa hin jiru” jedha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:14">galaannis, “Inni na bira hin jiru” jedha.<verse eid="JOB 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15"/>Warqeen qulqulluun isa bituu hin dandaʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:15">gatiin isaas meetiidhaan hin madaalamu.<verse eid="JOB 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16"/>Warqee Oofiiriitti, dhagaa gatii guddaa sardooniksiitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:16">yookaan sanpeeriitti hin tilmaamamu.<verse eid="JOB 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17"/>Warqee fi dhagaan akka bilillee calaqqisu ittiin hin qixxaatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:17">inni faaya warqee qulqulluutiin hin geeddaramu.<verse eid="JOB 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18"/>Elellaanii fi dooqni akka waan gatii qabaniitti hin hedaman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:18">gatiin ogummaa lula diimaa caala.<verse eid="JOB 28:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19"/>Tophaaziyooniin Itoophiyaa itti qixxaatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:19">warqee qulqulluudhaanis bitamuu hin dandaʼu.<verse eid="JOB 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20"/>Yoos ogummaan eessaa dhufti ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:20">Hubannaanis eessa jiraatti?<verse eid="JOB 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21"/>Isheen ija uumama hundaa jalaa dhokatteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:21">simbirroota samii jalaas baddeerti.<verse eid="JOB 28:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22"/>Badiisnii fi Duuti, “Nu oduu ishee qofa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:22">gurra keenyaan dhageenye” jedhu.<verse eid="JOB 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23"/>Waaqa qofatu daandii gara ishee geessu hubatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:23">lafa inni jiraatus beeka;<verse eid="JOB 28:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24"/>inni handaara lafaa ni ilaala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:24">waan samii jala jiru hunda ni argaatii.<verse eid="JOB 28:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25"/>Inni yommuu bubbeedhaaf humna kennee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:25">bishaanota safaretti,<verse eid="JOB 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26"/>yommuu bokkaadhaaf seera dhaabee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:26">bakakkaaf immoo daandii baasetti,<verse eid="JOB 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27"/>inni ogummaa ilaalee madaale;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:27">jabeessee dhaabee ishee qorate.<verse eid="JOB 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28"/>Ergasii ilmaan namaatiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">“Gooftaa sodaachuun ogummaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">waan hamaa irraa fagaachuunis hubannaa dha” jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 28:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1"/>Iyyoob haasaa isaa itti fufee akkana jedhe:<verse eid="JOB 29:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2"/>“Ani jiʼoota darban, bara Waaqni na eege sana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:2">akkamin hawwa ture,<verse eid="JOB 29:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3"/>yeroo ibsaan isaa mataa koo irratti ife, anis ifa isaatiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:3">dukkana keessa darbee yeroon deeme,<verse eid="JOB 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4"/>yeroo ani nama jabaa ture,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:4">yeroo michummaan Waaqaa mana koo eebbise,<verse eid="JOB 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5"/>yeroo Waaqni Waan Hunda Dandaʼu na wajjin ture,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:5">yeroo ijoolleen koo naannoo koo turan,<verse eid="JOB 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6"/>yeroo daandiin koo dhadhaadhaan jiifame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:6">yeroo kattaanis laga zayitii ejersaa naaf yaase.<verse eid="JOB 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7"/>“Yeroo ani gara karra magaalaatti gad baʼee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:7">oobdii sabaa keessa barcuma koo irra taaʼe,<verse eid="JOB 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8"/>dargaggeeyyiin na arganii karaa irraa goru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:8">maanguddoonnis kaʼanii dhaabatu ture;<verse eid="JOB 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9"/>hangafoonni sabaa dubbii afaanitti qabatanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:9">harka isaanii afaan irra kaaʼatu ture;<verse eid="JOB 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10"/>sagaleen namoota bebeekamoo hin dhagaʼamu ture;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:10">arrabni isaaniis laagaa isaaniitti ni maxxana ture.<verse eid="JOB 29:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11"/>Namni na dhagaʼu kam iyyuu na jaja;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:11">kanneen na arganis na galateeffatu ture;<verse eid="JOB 29:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12"/>ani hiyyeessa gargaarsa barbaachaaf booʼu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:12">nama abbaa hin qabne kan namni isa gargaaru tokko iyyuu hin jirre fureeraatii.<verse eid="JOB 29:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13"/>Namni duʼuu gaʼe na eebbiseera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:13">ani akka garaan haadha hiyyeessaa gammachuun ililchus godheera.<verse eid="JOB 29:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14"/>Qajeelummaa akka uffata kootti uffadheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:14">murtiin qajeelaan immoo uffata koo fi marata mataa koo ture.<verse eid="JOB 29:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15"/>Ani nama jaameef ija,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:15">okkolaaf immoo miilla taʼeen ture.<verse eid="JOB 29:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16"/>Ani rakkataadhaaf abbaan ture;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:16">nama ormaatiif illee nan falman ture.<verse eid="JOB 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17"/>Qarriffaa nama hamaa nan cabse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:17">waan inni qabates afaan isaatii buuseera.<verse eid="JOB 29:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18"/>“Ani akkana jedheen yaadee ture; ‘Manuma koo keessattin duʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:18">barri jireenya kootiis akkuma cirrachaa baayʼata.<verse eid="JOB 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19"/>Hiddi koo gad fagaatee bishaan qaqqaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:19">fixeensis halkan guutuu dameewwan koo irra bula.<verse eid="JOB 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20"/>Ulfinni koo na keessatti haaraa taʼee jiraata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:20">iddaanis harka koo keessatti haaromfama.’<verse eid="JOB 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21"/>“Namoonni calʼisanii gorsa koo eeggachaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:21">abdiidhaan na dhaggeeffatu.<verse eid="JOB 29:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22"/>Erga ani dubbadhee booddee isaan deebiʼanii hin dubbanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:22">dubbiin koos akka gaariitti gurra isaanii seena ture.<verse eid="JOB 29:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23"/>Isaan akkuma nama bokkaa eeggatuutti na eeggatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:23">dubbii koos akkuma bokkaa arfaasaa dhugan.<verse eid="JOB 29:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24"/>Yeroo ani isaaniif seequtti isaan hin amanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:24">ifni fuula koos isaaniif waan guddaa ture.<verse eid="JOB 29:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25"/>Ani karaa isaaniif filee akka hangafa isaaniitti nan taaʼe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">akka mootii loltoota isaa gidduu jiraatuutti nan jiraadhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">ani akka nama warra booʼan jajjabeessuus taʼe.<verse eid="JOB 29:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1"/>“Amma garuu warri umuriidhaan naa gadii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">kanneen ani abbootii isaanii</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:1">saroota hoolota koo tiksitu wajjin iyyuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">madaaluu tuffadhe, kunoo natti qoosu.<verse eid="JOB 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2"/>Warra humna dhaban,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:2">jabinni irree isaanii maal na fayyada?<verse eid="JOB 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3"/>Isaan rakkinaa fi beelaan laafan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:3">lafa gogaa keessa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:3">gammoojjii namni keessa hin jiraanne keessa halkaniin jooran.<verse eid="JOB 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4"/>Daggala keessaa biqiltuu soogiddaa funaannatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:4">nyaanni isaaniis hidda mukaa kan hin miʼoofne ture.<verse eid="JOB 30:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5"/>Isaan namoota gidduudhaa ariʼaman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:5">namoonnis akkuma waan hattuutti iyyaniitti itti iyyan.<verse eid="JOB 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6"/>Isaan akka laga gogaa keessa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:6">kattaa gidduu fi boolla lafaa keessa jiraataniif dirqamaman.<verse eid="JOB 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7"/>Bosona keessatti ni halaaku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:7">daggala keessattis walitti tuutaʼu.<verse eid="JOB 30:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8"/>Isaan gowwoota maqaa hin qabne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:8">kanneen biyyaa ariʼaman turan.<verse eid="JOB 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9"/>“Amma ilmaan isaanii sirba natti baafatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:9">ani isaan gidduutti waan kolfaa taʼeera.<verse eid="JOB 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10"/>Isaan xireeffatanii narraa fagaatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:10">fuula kootti tufuu irraas duubatti hin deebiʼan.<verse eid="JOB 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11"/>Sababii Waaqni iddaa koo laafisee gad na deebiseef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:11">isaan fuula koo duratti luugama baafatan.<verse eid="JOB 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12"/>Karaa mirga kootiin addaggeewwan kaʼaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">miilla kootiif kiyyoo kaaʼaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">biyyoos akka dallaa natti naannessan.<verse eid="JOB 30:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13"/>Isaan karaa koo natti cufu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:13">na galaafachuufis ni milkaaʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:13">namni isaan dhowwu tokko iyyuu hin jiru.<verse eid="JOB 30:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14"/>Akkuma nama qaawwa balʼaan dhufuutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:14">ona diigamaa keessa gangalachaa natti dhufu.<verse eid="JOB 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15"/>Sodaan na liqimseera; ulfinni koo akkuma waan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">bubbeedhaan fudhatamuutti narraa fudhatameera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">badhaadhummaan koos akkuma duumessaa bada.<verse eid="JOB 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16"/>“Amma lubbuun koo na keessatti dhumteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:16">barri rakkinaas na qabateera.<verse eid="JOB 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17"/>Halkan keessa lafeen koo ni waraanama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:17">dhukkubbiin na nyaatus natti hin furu.<verse eid="JOB 30:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18"/>Waaqni humna jabaadhaan uffata koo qabeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:18">akkuma morma wayyaa kootti hudhee na qabeera.<verse eid="JOB 30:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19"/>Inni darbatee dhoqqee keessa na buusa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:19">anis akkuma biyyoo fi daaraa taʼeera.<verse eid="JOB 30:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20"/>“Yaa Waaqi, ani sitti nan iyyadha; ati garuu deebii naa hin kennitu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:20">ani nan dhaabadha; ati garuu calʼistee na ilaalta.<verse eid="JOB 30:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21"/>Ati gara jabinaan natti garagalta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:21">irree kee jabaadhaanis na dhoofta.<verse eid="JOB 30:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22"/>Ol na buttee fuula bubbee dura na oofta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:22">bubbee hamaa keessas asii fi achi na aata.<verse eid="JOB 30:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23"/>Ani akka ati gara duʼaatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:23">gara mana warra lubbuun jiraatan hundaaf ramadameetti <optbreak/> na geessitu nan beeka.<verse eid="JOB 30:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24"/>“Dhuguma iyyuu yeroo inni rakkatee gargaarsa barbaachaaf iyyutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:24">namni harka isaa isa irra kaaʼu tokko iyyuu hin jiru.<verse eid="JOB 30:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25"/>Ani warra rakkina keessa jiraniif hin boonyee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:25">Lubbuun koos hiyyeeyyiif hin gaddinee?<verse eid="JOB 30:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26"/>Garuu utuu ani waan gaarii abdadhuu, wanni hamaan natti dhufe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:26">utuu ani ifa eeggadhuus, dukkanni natti dhufe.<verse eid="JOB 30:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27"/>Keessi koo jeeqamaa jira; gonkumaa hin qabbanoofne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:27">barri gidiraas natti dhufeera.<verse eid="JOB 30:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28"/>Ani jajjabina dhabee asii fi achi deemee nan booʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:28">waldaa keessa dhaabadhees gargaarsaaf nan iyya.<verse eid="JOB 30:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29"/>Ani obboleessa waangoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:29">michuu urunguus taʼeera.<verse eid="JOB 30:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30"/>Gogaan koo gurraachaʼee qolli irraa kaʼeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:30">dhagni koos hoʼaan bobaʼeera.<verse eid="JOB 30:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31"/>Baganaan koo booʼichaaf, ululleen koo immoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:31">sagalee iyyaatiif qopheeffameera.<verse eid="JOB 30:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1"/>“Ani ija koo wajjin kakuu galeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:1">yoos ani akkamiin hawwiidhaan gara durbaa ilaala ree?<verse eid="JOB 31:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2"/>Carraan namni Waaqa samii biraa qabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:2">dhaalli inni Waaqa Waan Hunda Dandaʼu irraa argatu maali?<verse eid="JOB 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3"/>Hamootaaf badiisa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:3">warra jalʼina hojjetaniif immoo dhaʼicha mitii?<verse eid="JOB 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4"/>Inni karaa koo hin arguu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:4">Tarkaanfii koo hundas hin lakkaaʼuu?<verse eid="JOB 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5"/>“Yoo ani karaa sobaa irra deemee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:5">yookaan miilli koo gara gowwoomsaatti ariifatee jiraate,<verse eid="JOB 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6"/>Waaqni madaalii dhugaatiin na haa madaalu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:6">akka ani hirʼina hin qabne illee haa beeku;<verse eid="JOB 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7"/>yoo tarkaanfiin koo karaa irraa goree,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">garaan koo waan iji koo argu duukaa buʼee jiraate</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">yookaan yoo harki koo xuraaʼee jiraate,<verse eid="JOB 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8"/>waan ani facaafadhe namni biraa haa nyaatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:8">midhaan koos haa buqqifamu.<verse eid="JOB 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9"/>“Yoo garaan koo dubartiidhaan gowwoomfamee jiraate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:9">yookaan yoo ani balbala ollaa koo jalatti riphee eeggadhe,<verse eid="JOB 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10"/>niitiin koo midhaan nama biraa haa daaktu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:10">namoonni biraas ishee wajjin haa ciisan.<verse eid="JOB 31:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11"/>Kun hammina;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:11">kan abbaa murtiitiinis adabamuu qabuu dha.<verse eid="JOB 31:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12"/>Kun ibidda hamma Barbadeessutti waa gubuu dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:12">midhaan ani qabu hundas gubee balleessa ture.<verse eid="JOB 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13"/>“Yoo ani yeroo isaan na himatanitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:13">tajaajiltoota koo dhiiraa fi dubartii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:13">murtii qajeelaa dhowwadhee jiraadhe,<verse eid="JOB 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14"/>yeroo Waaqni kaʼutti ani maalan godha?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:14">Yoo inni na gaafates ani maalan deebisa?<verse eid="JOB 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15"/>Isuma gadameessa keessatti na uume sanatu isaan uume mitii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:15">Kan hunda keenya gadameessa keessatti tolches isuma mitii?<verse eid="JOB 31:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16"/>“Yoo ani waan hiyyeessaaf barbaachisu dhowwadhee jiraadhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:16">yookaan yoo ani akka iji haadha hiyyeessaa dadhabu godhee jiraadhe,<verse eid="JOB 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17"/>yoo ani buddeena koo utuu ilma abbaa hin qabneef hin qoodin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:17">kophaa koo nyaadhee jiraadhe,<verse eid="JOB 31:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18"/>ani garuu dargaggummaa kootii jalqabee akkuma abbaattin isa guddise;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:18">dhaloota kootii jalqabees haadha hiyyeessaa karaa argisiise.<verse eid="JOB 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19"/>Ani yoon utuu namni tokko wayyaa dhabee akka malee miidhamuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:19">yookaan rakkataa uffata of irraa hin qabne tokko argee<verse eid="JOB 31:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20"/>sababii ani rifeensa hoolota kootiin isa hoʼiseef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:20">yoo garaan isaa na hin eebbisin,<verse eid="JOB 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21"/>yoo ani mana murtiitti fudhatama qaba jedhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:21">ijoollee abbaa hin qabnetti harka koo ol kaasee jiraadhe,<verse eid="JOB 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22"/>irreen koo gatiittii koo irraa haa buqqaʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:22">irreen koo buusaa isaatti haa cabu.<verse eid="JOB 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23"/>Ani sababiin dhaʼicha Waaqaa sodaadhee fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:23">sababiin surraa isaa kabajeef waan akkanaa hojjechuu hin dandeenye.<verse eid="JOB 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24"/>“Yoo ani warqee abdadhee yookaan warqee qulqulluudhaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:24">‘Ati irkoo koo ti’ jedhee jiraadhe,<verse eid="JOB 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25"/>yoo ani qabeenya koo guddaatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:25">milkaaʼina harki koo argatetti gammadee jiraadhe,<verse eid="JOB 31:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26"/>yoo ani aduu iftu argee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:26">yookaan jiʼa miidhaginaan deemu ilaalee kabajee,<verse eid="JOB 31:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27"/>akkasiinis garaan koo dhoksaan gowwoomfamee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:27">afaan koo harka koo dhungatee jiraate,<verse eid="JOB 31:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28"/>wanni kun cubbuu adabamuu qabuu dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:28">ani Waaqa samiitiif hin amanamne tureetii.<verse eid="JOB 31:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29"/>“Yoo ani badiisa diina kootiitti gammadee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:29">yookaan rakkina isa irra gaʼeef ililchee jiraadhe,<verse eid="JOB 31:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30"/>ani jireenya isaa abaaruudhaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:30">akka afaan koo cubbuu hojjetu hin eeyyamne.<verse eid="JOB 31:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31"/>Yoo namoonni mana koo jiraatan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:31">takkumaa, ‘Eenyutu buddeena mana Iyyoob nyaatee hin quufin?’ hin jedhin,<verse eid="JOB 31:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32"/>sababii manni koo karaa deemtuuf banaa tureef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:32">keessummaan kam iyyuu ala hin bulu ture.<verse eid="JOB 31:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33"/>Yoo ani akkuma namoonni godhan sana balleessaa koo garaatti qabadhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:33">cubbuu koos dhokfadhee jiraadhe,<verse eid="JOB 31:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34"/>ani waldaa guddaa sodaadhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:34">yookaan tuffiin gosaa na naasisee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:34">calʼisee gad baʼuu dhiiseeraa?<verse eid="JOB 31:34"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35"/>“Maaloo ani utuu nama na dhagaʼu argadhee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">Ani mallattoo falmii koo nan mallatteessa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:35">Waaqni Waan Hunda Dandaʼu deebii naaf haa kennu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">himataan koo dubbii isaa barreeffamaan haa dhiʼeeffatu.<verse eid="JOB 31:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36"/>Dhugumaan ani gatiittii koo irratti waan kana nan baadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:36">akka gonfoottis mataa irra nan kaaʼadhan ture.<verse eid="JOB 31:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37"/>Tokkoo tokkoo tarkaanfii koo isatti nan hima;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:37">akkuma ilma mootiittis isatti nan dhiʼaadhan ture.<verse eid="JOB 31:37"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38"/>“Yoo lafti koo natti iyyitee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:38">boʼoon ishee hundinuu imimmaaniin jiidhe,<verse eid="JOB 31:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39"/>yoo ani kaffaltii malee midhaan ishee nyaadhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:39">yookaan akka hojjettoonni isaa lubbuu isaanii dhaban godhee jiraadhe,<verse eid="JOB 31:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40"/>qooda qamadii qoraattiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:40">qooda garbuus aramaan itti haa biqilu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 31:40">Dubbiin Iyyoob xumurame.<verse eid="JOB 31:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32"/>
  <para style="s1">Eeliihuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1"/>Sababii Iyyoob nama qajeelaa of seʼeef namoonni sadan kunneen deebii kennuufii dhiisan. <verse eid="JOB 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2"/>Eliihuun ilmi Barakeel Buuzichi maatiin Raamii sun garuu sababii Iyyoob qooda Waaqaa qajeelaa of godheef akka malee itti aare. <verse eid="JOB 32:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3"/>Akkasumas sababii isaan Iyyoobitti muruu malee deebii hin qabaatiniif Eeliihuun michoota Iyyoob sadanitti akka malee aare. <verse eid="JOB 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4"/>Eliihuun waan namoonni sun umuriidhaan isa caalaniif utuu dursee Iyyoobitti hin dubbatin ture. <verse eid="JOB 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5"/>Garuu yeroo akka namoonni sun sadan waan dubbatan dhaban argetti aariin isaa ittuma caale.<verse eid="JOB 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6"/>Kanaafuu Eliihuun ilmi Barakeel Buuzichaa sun akkana jedhe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">“Ani umuriidhaan xinnaa dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">isin garuu jaarsolii dha;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">kanaafuu ani yaada koo isinitti himuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">nan saalfadhe; nan sodaadhes.<verse eid="JOB 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7"/>Ani, ‘Umuriin ni dubbata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:7">barri dheeraanis ogummaa barsiisa’ jedhee yaadeen ture.<verse eid="JOB 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8"/>Garuu hafuura nama keessa jiru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:8">hafuura Waaqni Waan Hunda Dandaʼu itti baafatutu hubannaa kennaaf.<verse eid="JOB 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9"/>Ogeessi jaarsa qofa miti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:9">kan waan qajeelaa hubatus, nama umurii dheeraa qofa miti.<verse eid="JOB 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10"/>“Kanaafuu ani akkana nan jedhaa na dhaggeeffadhaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:10">anis waanan beeku isinitti nan hima.<verse eid="JOB 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11"/>Ani yeroo isin dubbattan nan obse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:11">yeroo isin jechoota filattanitti illee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:11">ani dubbii ogummaa kan isin dubbattan nan dhaggeeffadhe;<verse eid="JOB 32:11"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12"/>ani qalbeeffadheen isin dhagaʼe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:12">Garuu isin keessaa namni tokko iyyuu akka inni dogoggore <optbreak/> Iyyoobin hin amansiifne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:12">namni tokko iyyuu falmii isaatiif deebii hin kennine.<verse eid="JOB 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13"/>Isin, ‘Nu ogummaa arganneerra;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:13">nama utuu hin taʼin, Waaqni isa irra haa aanu’ hin jedhinaa.<verse eid="JOB 32:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14"/>Iyyoob garuu dubbii isaatiin na hin tuqne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:14">anis falmii keessaniin deebii isaaf hin kennu.<verse eid="JOB 32:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15"/>“Isaan abdii kutatanii waan jedhan dhaban;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:15">dubbiinis isaan harkaa badde.<verse eid="JOB 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16"/>Erga isaan calʼisanii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:16">erga isaan deebii kennan tokko illee dhabanii achi dhadhaabatanii, <optbreak/> ani eeguun qabaa?<verse eid="JOB 32:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17"/>Ani deebii koo nan kenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:17">waanan beeku nan hima.<verse eid="JOB 32:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18"/>Dubbiin na keessa guuteeraatii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:18">hafuurri na keessa jirus na kakaasa;<verse eid="JOB 32:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19"/>garaan koo akkuma daadhii wayinii kan qadaadamee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:19">akkuma qalqalloo daadhii wayinii haaraa dhoʼuun gaʼeetii.<verse eid="JOB 32:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20"/>Ani dubbadhee qabbaneeffachuun qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:20">afaan koo banadhees deebii kennuun qaba.<verse eid="JOB 32:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21"/>Ani nama wal hin caalchisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:21">yookaan nama tokko iyyuu hin saadu.<verse eid="JOB 32:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22"/>Utuu ani nama saaduu beekee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:22">Uumaan koo silaa dafee lafa irraa na balleessa ture.<verse eid="JOB 32:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1"/>“Yaa Iyyoob amma garuu ati dubbii koo dhaggeeffadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:1">waan ani jedhu hundas dhagaʼi.<verse eid="JOB 33:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2"/>Kunoo ani afaan koo nan banadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:2">dubbiin koos fiixee arraba kootii irra jira.<verse eid="JOB 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3"/>Dubbiin koo garaa qajeelaa keessaa baʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:3">hidhiin koos waan ani beeku ifatti baasee dubbata.<verse eid="JOB 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4"/>Hafuura Waaqaatu na uume;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:4">hafuurri Waaqni Waan Hunda Dandaʼu baafatus jireenya naa kenna.<verse eid="JOB 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5"/>Egaa yoo dandeesse deebii naa kenni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:5">qophaaʼiitii fuula koo dura dhaabadhu.<verse eid="JOB 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6"/>Ani fuula Waaqaa duratti namuma akka keetii ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:6">anis biyyoo irraan hojjetame.<verse eid="JOB 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7"/>Ati na sodaattee hin raafamin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:7">harki koos sitti hin ulfaatin.<verse eid="JOB 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8"/>“Dhugumaan ati utuma ani dhagaʼuu dubbatteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:8">anis dubbii kee dhagaʼeera.<verse eid="JOB 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9"/>Ati akkana jetta: ‘Ani qulqulluu dha; cubbuu illee hin qabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:9">ani balleessaa hin qabu; yakka illee hin hojjenne.<verse eid="JOB 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10"/>Waaqni garuu balleessaa narratti argeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:10">akka diina isaattis na ilaaleera.<verse eid="JOB 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11"/>Miilla koo gudeelcha gidduu galchee hidha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:11">karaa koo hundas ni eega.’<verse eid="JOB 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12"/>“Garuu ani sitti nan hima; kana irratti ati qajeelaa miti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:12">Waaqni nama caalaa guddaadhaatii.<verse eid="JOB 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13"/>Ati maaliif akka waan inni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:13">dubbii namaatiif deebii hin kennineetti isatti guungumta?<verse eid="JOB 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14"/>Namni hubachuu baattu iyyuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:14">Waaqni karaa tokkoonis, karaa biraatiinis ni dubbata.<verse eid="JOB 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15"/>Inni utuma isaan siree isaanii irra ciisanuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:15">yeroo hirribni cimaan isaan qabutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:15">abjuudhaan, mulʼata halkaniitiinis,<verse eid="JOB 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16"/>gurra isaaniitti ni dubbata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:16">of eeggachiisaanis isaan rifachiisa;<verse eid="JOB 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17"/>jalʼina irraa nama deebisuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:17">of jajuu irraas isa dhowwuuf,<verse eid="JOB 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18"/>lubbuu isaa boolla irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:18">jireenya isaas goraadeedhaan baduu irraa oolchuudhaaf.<verse eid="JOB 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19"/>“Namni tokko dhiphina lafee isaa keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:19">kan gargar hin cinneen, siree dhiphinaa irratti ni adabama taʼa;<verse eid="JOB 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20"/>kanaafuu jireenyi isaa nyaata jibba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:20">lubbuun isaas nyaata filatamaa balfiti.<verse eid="JOB 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21"/>Foon isaa nyaatamee dhuma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:21">lafeen isaa kan duraan dhokatee ture sun alatti yaaʼa.<verse eid="JOB 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22"/>Lubbuun isaa gara boollaatti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:22">jireenyi isaas ergamoota duʼaatti dhiʼaata.<verse eid="JOB 33:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23"/>Taʼus yoo kuma keessaa ergamaan Waaqayyoo tokko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:23">akka itti qajeelaa taʼan isaanitti himuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:23">ergamaan Waaqaa isaanii dhaabatee jiraate,<verse eid="JOB 33:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24"/>yoo namichaaf garaa laafee ‘Boolla buʼuu irraa isa oolche;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:24">ani furii isaaf argeen jira’ jedhe,<verse eid="JOB 33:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25"/>dhagni isaa akkuma dhagna daaʼimaatti haaromfama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:25">akka bara dargaggummaa isaattis ni deebiʼa.<verse eid="JOB 33:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26"/>Inni Waaqa ni kadhata; isa birattis fudhatama argata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">fuula Waaqaa ni arga; ni ililchas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">Waaqnis gara qajeelummaa isaa kan duriitti isa ni deebisa.<verse eid="JOB 33:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27"/>Ergasiis gara namootaa dhufee akkana jedha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">‘Ani cubbuu hojjedheera; waan qajeelaas jalʼiseera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">garuu waan naa malu hin arganne.<verse eid="JOB 33:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28"/>Inni akka isheen boolla hin buuneef lubbuu koo fureera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:28">anis jiraadhee ifa nan arga.’<verse eid="JOB 33:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29"/>“Waaqni waan kana hunda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:29">yeroo lama, yeroo sadii iyyuu namaaf ni godha.<verse eid="JOB 33:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30"/>Kanas akka ifni jireenyaa isaaf ifuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:30">lubbuu isaas boolla irraa deebisuuf godha.<verse eid="JOB 33:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31"/>“Yaa Iyyoob qalbeeffadhuutii na dhaggeeffadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:31">ati calʼisi; ani nan dubbadhaa.<verse eid="JOB 33:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32"/>Yoo waan jettu tokko illee qabaatte deebii naa kenni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:32">dubbadhu, ani akka ati qajeelaa taate mirkaneessuu nan barbaadaatii.<verse eid="JOB 33:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33"/>Yoo akkas taʼuu baate garuu na dhaggeeffadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:33">calʼisi, anis ogummaa sin barsiisaa.”<verse eid="JOB 33:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1"/>Eliihuun akkana jedhe:<verse eid="JOB 34:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2"/>“Yaa ogeeyyii, dubbii koo dhagaʼaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:2">beektonnis na dhaggeeffadhaa.<verse eid="JOB 34:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3"/>Akkuma arrabni nyaata afaaniin qabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:3">gurris dubbii calalaatii.<verse eid="JOB 34:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4"/>Waan qajeelaa taʼe ofii keenyaaf haa filannu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:4">waan gaariis tokkummaadhaan haa barannu.<verse eid="JOB 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5"/>“Iyyoob akkana jedha; ‘Ani qajeelaa dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:5">Waaqni garuu murtii qajeelaa narraa fudhate.<verse eid="JOB 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6"/>Ani utuman nama dhugaa taʼee jiruu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">akka sobduuttin herregame;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:6">ani yakka qabaachuu baadhu illee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">xiyyi isaa madaa hin fayyineen na madeesseera.’<verse eid="JOB 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7"/>Namni akka bishaaniitti tuffii dhugu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:7">kan akka Iyyoob eenyu?<verse eid="JOB 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8"/>Inni warra hammina hojjetu wajjin walii gala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:8">jalʼoota wajjinis tokkummaa qabaata.<verse eid="JOB 34:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9"/>Inni, ‘Waaqa gammachiisuu yaaluun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:9">namaaf faayidaa tokko iyyuu hin qabu’ jedhaatii.<verse eid="JOB 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10"/>“Kanaafuu isin yaa hubattoota, na dhagaʼaa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">Waan hamaa hojjechuun Waaqa irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">dogoggoruunis Waaqa Waan Hunda Dandaʼu irraa haa fagaatu.<verse eid="JOB 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11"/>Inni namaaf akkuma hojii isaatti gatii ni kenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:11">waan karaa isaatiif malus itti fida.<verse eid="JOB 34:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12"/>Dhugumaan Waaqni hammina hin hojjetu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:12">Waaqni Waan Hunda Dandaʼu murtii qajeelaa hin jalʼisu.<verse eid="JOB 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13"/>Eenyutu lafa irratti isa muude?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:13">Eenyutus addunyaa guutuu isatti kenne?<verse eid="JOB 34:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14"/>Utuu inni hafuura isaa deebisee fudhatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:14">hafuura baafatu illee gara ofii isaatti deebifatee,<verse eid="JOB 34:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15"/>silaa sanyiin namaa hundi walumaan bada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:15">namnis biyyootti deebiʼa ture.<verse eid="JOB 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16"/>“Ati yoo hubannaa qabaatte waan kana dhagaʼi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:16">waan ani jedhus dhaggeeffadhu.<verse eid="JOB 34:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17"/>Namni murtii qajeelaa jibbu bulchuu dandaʼaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:17">Atis isa qajeelaa fi humna qabeessa sanatti murtaa?<verse eid="JOB 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18"/>Kan moototaan, ‘Isin faayidaa hin qabdan;’ jedhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:18">qondaaltotaanis, ‘Isin hamoo dha’ jedhu isa mitii?<verse eid="JOB 34:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19"/>Inni ilmaan moototaatiif illee hin looguu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">sooreyyii fi hiyyeeyyii wal hin caalchisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">hundi isaanii hojii harka isaatii.<verse eid="JOB 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20"/>Isaan halkan walakkaa tasa duʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">namoonni hollatanii dhumu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">jajjaboonnis utuma harki namaa isaan hin tuqin ni badu.<verse eid="JOB 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21"/>“Iji isaa karaa namootaa irra jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:21">inni tarkaanfii isaanii hunda ni arga.<verse eid="JOB 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22"/>Iddoon warri waan hamaa hojjetan itti dhokatan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:22">dukkanni yookaan gaaddisni guddaan hin jiru.<verse eid="JOB 34:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23"/>Akka inni murtiidhaaf fuula isaa duratti dhiʼaatuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:23">Waaqni nama kam iyyuu hin beellamu.<verse eid="JOB 34:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24"/>Inni gaaffii tokko malee namoota jajjaboo ni burkuteessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:24">warra biraa immoo iddoo isaanii ni kaaʼa.<verse eid="JOB 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25"/>Inni sababii hojii isaanii beekuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:25">halkan keessa isaan garagalcha; isaanis ni barbadaaʼu.<verse eid="JOB 34:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26"/>Sababii jalʼina isaaniitiifis</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:26">inni iddoo namni hundi argutti isaan adaba;<verse eid="JOB 34:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27"/>kunis waan isaan isa duukaa buʼuu irraa garagalanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:27">karaa isaa hunda dhiisaniif.<verse eid="JOB 34:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28"/>Isaan akka inni iyya rakkattootaa dhagaʼuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:28">akka iyyi hiyyeeyyii fuula isaa duratti dhagaʼamu godhaniiru.<verse eid="JOB 34:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29"/>Yoo inni calʼise garuu, eenyutu isatti muruu dandaʼa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:29">Yoo inni fuula isaa dhokfates eenyutu isa arguu dandaʼa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:29">Taʼus inni namaa fi saba illee ni toʼata;<verse eid="JOB 34:29"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30"/>kunis akka namni Waaqaaf hin bulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:30">mootii hin taanee fi akka isaan sabaaf kiyyoo hin keenyeefii dha.<verse eid="JOB 34:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31"/>“Namni tokko Waaqaan akkana jedha haa jennu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:31">‘Ani yakka hojjedheera; garuu itti hin deebiʼu.<verse eid="JOB 34:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32"/>Waan ani arguu hin dandeenye na barsiisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:32">ani yoon dogoggora hojjedhee jiraadhe, lammata itti hin deebiʼu.’<verse eid="JOB 34:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33"/>Waaqni sababii ati qalbii jijjiirrachuu didduuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">akkuma yaada keetiitti gatii siif baasaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:33">Situ murteessuu qaba malee ana miti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">kanaafuu ati waan beektu natti himi.<verse eid="JOB 34:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34"/>“Namoonni hubannaa qaban ni dubbatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:34">namoonni ogeeyyiin na dhagaʼanis akkana jedhu;<verse eid="JOB 34:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35"/>‘Iyyoob beekumsa malee dubbata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:35">dubbiin isaas hubannaa cimaa hin qabu.’<verse eid="JOB 34:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36"/>Iyyoob sababii akka nama hamaatti deebii kenneef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:36">maaloo utuu hamma dhumaatti qoramee jiraatee!<verse eid="JOB 34:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37"/>Inni cubbuu isaa irratti fincila dabala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">tuffiidhaan gidduu keenyatti harka dhaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">Waaqa irrattis waan baayʼee dubbata.”<verse eid="JOB 34:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1"/>Eliihuunis itti fufee akkana jedhe:<verse eid="JOB 35:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2"/>“Ati waan kana qajeelaa seetaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:2">Ati, ‘Ani fuula Waaqaa duratti qajeelaa dha’ jetta.<verse eid="JOB 35:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3"/>Ati, ‘Wanni kun faayidaa maalii naa qaba?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:3">Ani cubbuu hojjechuu dhiisuudhaan maalin argadha?’ jettee gaafatta.<verse eid="JOB 35:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4"/>“Ani siʼii fi michoota kee kanneen si wajjin jiraniif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:4">deebii kennuu nan barbaada.<verse eid="JOB 35:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5"/>Ol jedhiitii samiiwwan ilaali;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:5">duumessoota siin ol jiranis argi.<verse eid="JOB 35:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6"/>Ati yoo cubbuu hojjette maal isa miita?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:6">Cubbuun kees yoo baayʼate maal isa godha?<verse eid="JOB 35:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7"/>Ati yoo qajeelaa taate, maal isaaf kennita?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:7">Yookaan inni harka kee irraa maal argata?<verse eid="JOB 35:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8"/>Hamminni kee nama akka keetii qofa miidha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:8">qajeelummaan kees ilmaan namaa qofa fayyada.<verse eid="JOB 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9"/>“Waan cunqursaan itti hammaatteef namoonni ni iyyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:9">irree humna qabeessaa jalaa baʼuufis gargaarsaaf wawwaatu.<verse eid="JOB 35:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10"/>Garuu namni tokko iyyuu akkana hin jedhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:10">‘Waaqni Uumaan koo, inni halkaniin faarfannaa namaa kennu,<verse eid="JOB 35:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11"/>kan bineensota lafa irraa caalaa beektota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:11">simbirroo samii caalaas ogeeyyii nu godhu eessa jira?’<verse eid="JOB 35:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12"/>Inni sababii of tuulummaa jalʼootaatiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:12">yommuu namoonni iyyanitti deebii hin kennu.<verse eid="JOB 35:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13"/>Dhugumaan Waaqni iyya isaanii kan gatii hin qabne sana hin dhaggeeffatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:13">Waaqni Waan Hunda Dandaʼu iyya sanaaf gurra hin kennu.<verse eid="JOB 35:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14"/>Yoo ati, ‘Dubbiin koo fuula isaa dura jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">ani isa eeggachaan jira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:14">garuu isa arguu hin dandaʼu’ jette,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">inni hammam kanaa gad iyyuu xinneessee haa dhagaʼu ree!<verse eid="JOB 35:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15"/>Amma illee sababii dheekkamsi isaa nama hin adabneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:15">sababii inni balleessaa namaa akka waan guddaa tokkootti hin fudhanneef,<verse eid="JOB 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16"/>Iyyoob oduu faayidaa hin qabneen afaan bana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:16">beekumsa malees dubbii baayʼisa.”<verse eid="JOB 35:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1"/>Eliihuun ittuma fufee akkana jedhe:<verse eid="JOB 36:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2"/>“Ani akka qooda Waaqaa wanni jedhamu hedduun jiru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:2">sitti nan argisiisaatii mee xinnoo naa obsi.<verse eid="JOB 36:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3"/>Ani beekumsa koo fagoodhaa nan fida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:3">qajeelummaa Uumaa kootiis nan labsa.<verse eid="JOB 36:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4"/>Akka dubbiin koo soba hin taʼin mirkaneeffadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:4">kan beekumsaan hirʼina hin qabne tokko si wajjin jira.<verse eid="JOB 36:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5"/>“Waaqni jabaa dha; garuu eenyun iyyuu hin tuffatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:5">inni jabaa dha; kaayyoo isaattis cimee dhaabata.<verse eid="JOB 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6"/>Inni hamoota hin jiraachisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:6">warra rakkataniif garuu murtii qajeelaa ni kenna.<verse eid="JOB 36:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7"/>Ija isaa qajeeltota irraa hin buqqifatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">mootota wajjin teessoo irra isaan teessisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">bara baraanis ol isaan guddisa.<verse eid="JOB 36:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8"/>Garuu yoo namoonni foncaadhaan hidhaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:8">yoo funyoo rakkinaatiinis hidhaman,<verse eid="JOB 36:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9"/>inni hojii isaanii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:9">daba isaan of tuulummaan hojjetanis isaanitti ni hima.<verse eid="JOB 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10"/>Inni gurra isaanii sirreeffama dhaggeeffachuuf ni bana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:10">akka isaan waan hamaa irraa qalbii jijjiirratanis ni ajaja.<verse eid="JOB 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11"/>Isaan yoo ajajamanii isa tajaajilan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:11">bara jireenya isaanii badhaadhummaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:11">umurii isaaniis gammachuudhaan fixatu.<verse eid="JOB 36:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12"/>Yoo ajajamuu baatan garuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:12">goraadeedhaan badu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:12">beekumsa malees ni duʼu.<verse eid="JOB 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13"/>“Warri garaan isaanii Waaqa irraa fagaate, aarii of keessatti kuufatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:13">yommuu inni foncaan isaan hidhutti illee gargaarsa barbaachaaf hin iyyan.<verse eid="JOB 36:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14"/>Isaan dargaggummaa isaanii keessa duʼu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:14">jireenyi isaaniis xuraaʼota gidduutti bada.<verse eid="JOB 36:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15"/>Inni garuu warra dhiphatan dhiphina isaanii keessaa baasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:15">rakkoo isaanii keessattis isaanitti dubbata.<verse eid="JOB 36:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16"/>“Inni dhiphina keessaa si baasee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">gara lafa balʼaa dhiphina hin qabneetti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">maaddii coomaan guutametti si geessa.<verse eid="JOB 36:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17"/>Amma garuu murtiin hamootaaf malu sirra tuulameera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:17">murtii fi haqni si qabataniiru.<verse eid="JOB 36:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18"/>Akka badhaadhummaan si hin gowwoomsine of eeggadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:18">akka baayʼinni mattaʼaas karaa irraa si jalʼisu hin godhin.<verse eid="JOB 36:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19"/>Badhaadhummaan kee yookaan tattaaffiin kee guddaan sun hundi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:19">rakkoo irraa si eeguu dandaʼaa?<verse eid="JOB 36:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20"/>Halkan itti namoonni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:20">mana isaaniitii buqqifaman hin hawwin.<verse eid="JOB 36:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21"/>Ati akka hamminatti hin deebine of eeggadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:21">qooda rakkinaa waan kana filatteertaatii.<verse eid="JOB 36:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22"/>“Kunoo Waaqni humna isaatiin ol ol jedheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:22">barsiisaan akka isaa eenyu?<verse eid="JOB 36:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23"/>Namni karaa isatti himu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:23">yookaan kan, ‘Ati dogoggorteerta’ isaan jedhu eenyu?<verse eid="JOB 36:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24"/>Hojii isaa kan namoonni faarfannaadhaan jajan sana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:24">leellisuu hin dagatin.<verse eid="JOB 36:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25"/>Namni hundinuu argeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:25">tokkoon tokkoon namaas fagootti xiyyeeffatee ilaala.<verse eid="JOB 36:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26"/>Dhugumaan Waaqni guddaa dha; nus isa hin beeknu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:26">baayʼina bara isaas namni beekuu hin dandaʼu.<verse eid="JOB 36:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27"/>“Inni copha bishaanii ol baasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:27">hurrii isaas walitti qabee bokkaatti geeddara.<verse eid="JOB 36:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28"/>Duumessis jiidha isaa gad coccobsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:28">bokkaan guddaanis namatti rooba.<verse eid="JOB 36:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29"/>Eenyutu akka inni itti duumessoota diriirsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:29">akka inni itti dunkaana isaa keessaa qaqawweessaʼus hubachuu dandaʼa?<verse eid="JOB 36:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30"/>Akka inni itti bakakkaa naannoo isaatti bittinneessu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:30">akka inni itti tuujuba galaanaa illee haguugu ilaali.<verse eid="JOB 36:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31"/>Kun haala inni ittiin saboota bulchuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:31">nyaata baayʼinaan isaaniif kennuu dha.<verse eid="JOB 36:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32"/>Inni harka isaa bakakkaadhaan ni guuta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:32">akka bakakkaan sun iddoo akeeka isaa dhaʼus ni ajaja.<verse eid="JOB 36:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33"/>Kakawween isaa akka bakakkaan dhufu labsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:33">looni iyyuu akka inni dhiʼaate beeksisu.<verse eid="JOB 36:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1"/>“Kana irratti onneen koo ni dhikkifata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:1">iddoo isaatiis ni uʼutaala.<verse eid="JOB 37:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2"/>Dhaggeeffadhaa! Iyya sagalee isaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:2">guungummii afaan isaatii baʼu illee dhagaʼaa.<verse eid="JOB 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3"/>Inni bakakkaa isaa samii hunda jalatti gad dhiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:3">gara handaara lafaattis ni erga.<verse eid="JOB 37:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4"/>Ergasii sagaleen guungummii isaa ni dhufa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">inni sagalee isaa ulfina qabeessa sanaan ni qaqawweessaʼa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:4">Yommuu sagaleen isaa dhagaʼamutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">inni waan tokko illee hin qusatu.<verse eid="JOB 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5"/>Sagaleen Waaqaa haala dinqisiisaadhaan ni qaqawweessaʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:5">inni waan guddaa hubannaa keenyaa ol taʼe godha.<verse eid="JOB 37:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6"/>Inni cabbiidhaan, ‘Lafa irra buʼi;’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:6">tiifuudhaanis, ‘Bokkaa jabaa taʼi’ jedha.<verse eid="JOB 37:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7"/>Akka namni inni uume hundi hojii isaa beekuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:7">inni harka tokkoo tokkoo namaa chaappessa.<verse eid="JOB 37:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8"/>Bineensonni holqa isaaniitti galu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:8">daʼannoo isaanii keessas ni turu.<verse eid="JOB 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9"/>Bubbeen hamaan iddoo isaatii ni baʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:9">dhaamochis bubbee bittinneessu keessaa ni baʼa.<verse eid="JOB 37:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10"/>Hafuurri Waaqni baafatu cabbii uuma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:10">bishaanonni babalʼaanis ni ititu.<verse eid="JOB 37:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11"/>Inni duumessoota bishaan baachisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:11">bakakkaa isaas isaan keessa facaasa.<verse eid="JOB 37:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12"/>Isaan waan inni ajaju hunda hojjechuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:12">qajeelfama inni kennuun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:12">addunyaa hunda irra naannaʼu.<verse eid="JOB 37:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13"/>Inni namoota adabuuf, yookaan lafa isaa obaasee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:13">jaalala isaa argisiisuuf jedhee duumessa fida.<verse eid="JOB 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14"/>“Yaa Iyyoob waan kana dhaggeeffadhu; mee of qabiitii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:14">hojii Waaqaa isa dinqisiisaa sana hubadhu.<verse eid="JOB 37:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15"/>Waaqni akkamitti duumessoota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:15">akka ajajuu fi akkamitti akka balaqqeessisu ati ni beektaa?<verse eid="JOB 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16"/>Akka itti duumessoonni wal qixxaatanii rarraʼan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:16">hojii dinqisiisaa Waaqaa isa beekumsaan mudaa hin qabne sanaa beektaa?<verse eid="JOB 37:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17"/>Ati kan yeroo lafti bubbee kibbaatiin calʼistutti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:17">hoʼa wayyaa keetiitiin waxalamtu,<verse eid="JOB 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18"/>samii akkuma of-ilaalee naasii baqfamee jabaatu sana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:18">diriirsuu keessatti isa gargaaruu ni dandeessaa?<verse eid="JOB 37:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19"/>“Waan nu isaan jennu nutti himi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:19">nu sababii dukkana keenyaatiifuu dubbii keenya qajeelfachuu hin dandeenyu.<verse eid="JOB 37:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20"/>Akka ani dubbachuu fedhu isatti himamuu qabaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:20">Namni kam iyyuu liqimfamuuf ni gaafataa?<verse eid="JOB 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21"/>Erga qilleensi samiiwwan qulqulleessee booddee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:21">namni aduu humna guutuun iftu ilaaluu dandaʼu tokko iyyuu hin jiru.<verse eid="JOB 37:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22"/>Waaqni bareedina warqeetiin kaabaa ni dhufa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:22">inni ulfina isaa isa sodaachisaa sanaan ni dhufa.<verse eid="JOB 37:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23"/>Waaqni Waan Hunda Dandaʼu hubannaa keenyaa oli;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:23">inni humnaa fi murtii qajeelaadhaan guddaa dha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:23">qajeelummaan isaa baayʼee dha; inni nama hin cunqursu.<verse eid="JOB 37:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24"/>Kanaafuu, namoonni isa sodaatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:24">inni warra ogeeyyii of seʼan hunda waʼittuu hin hedu.”<verse eid="JOB 37:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38"/>
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Waaqayyo</char> Ni dubbata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1"/>Kana irratti <char style="nd">Waaqayyo</char> bubbee jabaa keessaa Iyyoobitti dubbate. Akkana jedhes:<verse eid="JOB 38:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2"/>“Namni dubbii beekumsa malee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:2">dubbatamuun karoora koo dukkanneessu kun eenyu?<verse eid="JOB 38:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3"/>Mee akka gootaa mudhii kee hidhadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:3">ani sin gaafadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:3">ati immoo deebii naa kenni.<verse eid="JOB 38:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4"/>“Yeroo ani hundee lafaa kaaʼetti ati eessa turte?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:4">Yoo hubatte mee natti himi.<verse eid="JOB 38:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5"/>Eenyutu balʼina ishee murteesse? Dhugumaan ni beektaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:5">Eenyutu ulee safaraa ishee irra harkise?<verse eid="JOB 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6"/>Hundeen ishee maal irra dhaabame?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:6">Yookaan eenyutu dhagaa golee ishee dhaabe?<verse eid="JOB 38:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7"/>Kunis yeroo bakkalchoonni barii walii wajjin faarfatanitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:7">yeroo ilmaan Waaqayyoos ililchanitti ture.<verse eid="JOB 38:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8"/>“Yeroo galaanni cabsee garaa lafaa keessaa baʼetti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:8">eenyutu balbala itti cufee ittise?<verse eid="JOB 38:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9"/>Yeroo ani duumessoota uffata isaa godhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:9">dukkana guddaan maretti,<verse eid="JOB 38:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10"/>yeroo ani daangaa isaa dhaabee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:10">balbalaa fi danqaraa hojjedheefitti,<verse eid="JOB 38:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11"/>anis, ‘Ati hamma asiitti dhufta; garuu darbuu hin dandeessu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:11">dambaliin of jajuu keetii illee asumatti dhaabata!’ jedheen.<verse eid="JOB 38:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12"/>“Ati bara jireenya keetii barraaqa ajajjee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:12">yookaan barii obborootti iddoo isaa argisiiftee beektaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13"/>Akka inni handaara lafaa qabatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:13">namoota hamoo achi keessaa hurgufu gooteertaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14"/>Lafti akka suphee chaappaa jala jiruutti bifa geeddaratti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:14">bifti ishees akka bifa uffataatti mulʼata.<verse eid="JOB 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15"/>Hamoonni ifa isaanii dhowwatamaniiru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:15">irreen isaanii inni ol kaʼes cabeera.<verse eid="JOB 38:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16"/>“Ati gara burqaa galaanaa gad buutee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:16">yookaan tuujuba bishaanii seentee hundee isaa irra deemtee beektaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17"/>Karri duʼaa sitti mulʼifameeraa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:17">Karra gaaddidduu duʼaas argiteertaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18"/>Balʼina lafaa guddaa sana hubatteertaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:18">Yoo kana hunda beekte dubbadhu.<verse eid="JOB 38:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19"/>“Karaan iddoo ifni jirutti nama geessu kami?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:19">Dukkannis eessa jiraata?<verse eid="JOB 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20"/>Iddoo isaaniitti isaan geessuu dandeessaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:20">Daandii lafa jireenya isaaniitti geessu beektaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21"/>Ati dhugumaan ni beekta; yeroo sana dhalatteertaatii!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:21">Ati bara hedduu jiraatteerta!<verse eid="JOB 38:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22"/>“Mankuusa cabbii seentee yookaan mankuusa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:22">dhagaa cabbii argiteertaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23"/>Kan ani yeroo rakkinaatiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:23">guyyaa waraanaa fi lolaatiif ol kaaʼadhe argiteertaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24"/>Karaan iddoo ifni itti bittinnaaʼutti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:24">yookaan gara iddoo bubbeen baʼaa itti lafa irra faffacaʼuutti nama geessu kami?<verse eid="JOB 38:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25"/>Eenyutu lolaadhaaf boʼoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:25">bakakkaadhaaf immoo daandii baasee,<verse eid="JOB 38:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26"/>lafa namni tokko iyyuu keessa hin jiraanne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:26">gammoojjii namni tokko iyyuu keessa hin jirre bishaan obaasuuf,<verse eid="JOB 38:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27"/>lafa namni keessa hin jiraannee fi lafa onaa quubsee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:27">margas itti biqilchu eenyu?<verse eid="JOB 38:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28"/>Roobni abbaa qabaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:28">Copha fixeensaa eenyutu dhalche?<verse eid="JOB 38:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29"/>Cabbiin garaa eenyuutii baʼa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:29">Qorra samii eenyutu dhala?<verse eid="JOB 38:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30"/>Bishaanonni akka dhagaa jabaatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:30">fuulli tuujubaas akka cabbii taʼa.<verse eid="JOB 38:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31"/>“Urjiiwwan babbareedoo Torbii jedhaman hidhuu ni dandeessaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:31">Yookaan hidhaa Urjii Sadee jedhamuu hiikuu ni dandeessaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32"/>Tuuta urjiiwwanii waqtiilee isaaniitti fiduu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:32">yookaan urjii Amaaketa jedhamu ilmaan isaa wajjin bobbaasuu ni dandeessaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33"/>Seera samiiwwanii beektaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:33">Bulchiinsa isaanii lafa irratti hundeessuu ni dandeessaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34"/>“Ati sagalee kee gara duumessaatti ol fudhattee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:34">lolaa bishaaniitiin of haguuguu ni dandeessaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35"/>Ati bakakkaa daandii isaa irra erguu ni dandeessaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:35">Innis, ‘Kunoo ani asan jira’ siin jedhaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36"/>Eenyutu yaada garaatiif ogummaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:36">yookaan sammuudhaaf hubannaa kenne?<verse eid="JOB 38:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37"/>Eenyutu duumessoota lakkaaʼuuf ogummaa qaba?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:37">Eenyutu okkotee bishaan samii<verse eid="JOB 38:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:38"/>yeroo biyyoon jabaattutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:38">yeroo supheen wal qabattutti jalʼisuu dandaʼa?<verse eid="JOB 38:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39"/>“Ati leenca dhalaadhaaf nyaata adamsitee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:39">saafela leencaas beela baaftee<verse eid="JOB 38:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40"/>yeroo isaan manʼee isaanii keessatti riphanitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:40">yookaan yeroo isaan daggala keessatti riphanii <optbreak/> waa eeggatanitti beela ni baaftaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41"/>Eenyutu yeroo ilmaan ishee gara Waaqaatti iyyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">yeroo isaan nyaata dhabanii jooranitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">arraagessaaf nyaata kenna?<verse eid="JOB 38:41"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoob</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1"/>“Yeroo itti qellejjeen dhaltu beektaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:1">Yeroo itti borofni ilmoo ishee dhaltu argiteertaa?<verse eid="JOB 39:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2"/>Jiʼa isaan garaatti ilmaan baatan ni lakkooftaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:2">Yeroo isaan itti dhalan ni beektaa?<verse eid="JOB 39:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3"/>Isaan jilbeenfatanii ilmaan isaanii dhalu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:3">foolachuu isaaniis ni hobbaafatu.<verse eid="JOB 39:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4"/>Ilmaan isaanii ni jabaatu; alattis ni guddatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:4">baʼanii ni deemu; hin deebiʼanis.<verse eid="JOB 39:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5"/>“Eenyutu harree diidaa gad dhiise?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:5">Funyoo isaas eenyutu hiike?<verse eid="JOB 39:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6"/>Ani gammoojjii mana isaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:6">lafa soogiddaas iddoo jireenya isaa godheen kenneef.<verse eid="JOB 39:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7"/>Inni waca magaalaa keessaatti ni kolfa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:7">iyya konkolaachisaas hin dhagaʼu.<verse eid="JOB 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8"/>Waan dheedu argachuuf tulluuwwan irra laba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:8">waan lalisaa hundas ni barbaada.<verse eid="JOB 39:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9"/>“Gafarsi si tajaajiluuf siif ajajamaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:9">Dallaa kee keessas ni bulaa?<verse eid="JOB 39:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10"/>Akka inni lafa siif qotuuf funyoodhaan isa hidhuu ni dandeessaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:10">Yookaan inni si duubaan boʼoo ni baasaa?<verse eid="JOB 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11"/>Ati waan inni humna guddaa qabuuf isa ni amanattaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:11">Hojii kee jabaa illee isatti ni dhiiftaa?<verse eid="JOB 39:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12"/>Akka inni midhaan kee walitti qabee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:12">oobdii kee irratti siif tuuluuf isa ni abdattaa?<verse eid="JOB 39:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13"/>“Guchiin gammachuudhaan qoochoo ishee afarsiti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:13">garuu qoochoo fi baallee huummootiin wal bira hin qabamu.<verse eid="JOB 39:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14"/>Hanqaaquu ishee lafa irratti buufti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:14">akka itti hoʼuufis cirracha keessatti dhiifti;<verse eid="JOB 39:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15"/>garuu akka miilli wayii caccabsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:15">akka bineensi irra ejjetu hin yaadattu.<verse eid="JOB 39:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16"/>Cuucii isheettis akka waan isaan kan ishee hin taʼiniitti garaa jabaatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:16">yoo dadhabbiin ishee akkasumaan bade illee isheef homaa miti;<verse eid="JOB 39:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17"/>Waaqni ogummaadhaan ishee hin badhaafneetii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:17">yookaan hubannaa isheef hin qoodne.<verse eid="JOB 39:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18"/>Yeroo fiiguuf qoochoo ishee balʼifattutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:18">isheen fardaa fi namicha gulufutti kofalti.<verse eid="JOB 39:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19"/>“Ati fardaaf jabina ni kennitaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:19">Yookaan morma isaatti gama uffisuu dandeessaa?<verse eid="JOB 39:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20"/>Akka inni akkuma hawwaannisaatti utaalu ni gootaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:20">Ulfinni korrisa isaas sodaachisaa dha.<verse eid="JOB 39:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21"/>Inni humna isaatti gammadee akka malee guulee lafa dhidhiita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:21">baʼees miʼa lolaatti qajeela.<verse eid="JOB 39:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22"/>Inni sodaatti ni kolfa; waan tokko illee hin sodaatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:22">goraadee irraas duubatti hin deebiʼu.<verse eid="JOB 39:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23"/>Manʼeen xiyyaa, eeboo fi ankaaseen calaqqisus</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:23">cinaacha isaatti bubbuʼee kililcha.<verse eid="JOB 39:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24"/>Siʼaaʼee rommuudhaan lafa haadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:24">yeroo malakanni afuufamutti illee obsee dhaabachuu hin dandaʼu.<verse eid="JOB 39:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25"/>Inni yommuu malakanni afuufamutti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">‘Uffee’ jedhee imimsa; waca ajajjootaatii fi iyya waraanaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">foolii waraanaa illee fagoottu suufa.<verse eid="JOB 39:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26"/>“Cululleen ogummaa keetiin barriftee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:26">qoochoo ishees gara kibbaatti balʼiftii?<verse eid="JOB 39:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27"/>Risaan ajaja keetiin ol baʼee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:27">ol fagootti mana isaa ijaarrataa?<verse eid="JOB 39:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28"/>Inni qarqara hallayyaa irra jiraata; halkanis achuma bula;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:28">kattaan fofottoqaanis daʼoo isaa ti.<verse eid="JOB 39:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29"/>Achi taaʼees waan nyaatu adamsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:29">iji isaas fagootti waan sana arga.<verse eid="JOB 39:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30"/>Cuucoliin isaa dhiiga dhugu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:30">innis lafa raqni jiruu hin dhabamu.”<verse eid="JOB 39:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1"/>
    <char style="nd">Waaqayyos</char> Iyyoobiin akkana jedhe:<verse eid="JOB 40:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2"/>“Namni Waaqa Waan Hunda Dandaʼuun falmu tokko isa ni qajeelchaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:2">Namni Waaqa himatu deebii haa kennuuf!”<verse eid="JOB 40:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3"/>Iyyoobis akkana jedhee <char style="nd">Waaqayyoof</char> deebise:<verse eid="JOB 40:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4"/>“Ani nama faayidaa hin qabnee dha; akkamittin deebii siif kenna?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:4">Harka koo afaan koo irra nan kaaʼadha.<verse eid="JOB 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5"/>Ani yeroo tokko dubbadheera; garuu ani waanan deebisu hin qabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:5">siʼa lama dubbadheera; kana caalaa garuu homaa hin jedhu.”<verse eid="JOB 40:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6"/>Kana irratti <char style="nd">Waaqayyo</char> bubbee jabaa keessaa Iyyoobitti dubbate:<verse eid="JOB 40:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7"/>“Akka dhiiraatti mudhii kee hidhadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:7">ani sin gaafadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:7">ati immoo deebii naa kennita.<verse eid="JOB 40:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8"/>“Ati murtii koo qajeelaa sana gatii dhabsiistaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:8">Ofii keetii qajeelaa taʼuuf na himattaa?<verse eid="JOB 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9"/>Irree akka irree Waaqaa qabdaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:9">Sagaleen kees akka sagalee isaa qaqawweessaʼuu dandaʼaa?<verse eid="JOB 40:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10"/>Ulfinaa fi guddinaan of miidhagsi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:10">kabajaa fi barreedina uffadhu.<verse eid="JOB 40:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11"/>Dheekkamsa kee kan guutee irra yaaʼu sana dhangalaasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:11">nama of tuulu kam iyyuu ilaalii qaanessi.<verse eid="JOB 40:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12"/>Nama of tuulu hunda ilaalii gad deebisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:12">hamoota illee iddoodhuma isaan dhaabatanitti caccabsi.<verse eid="JOB 40:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13"/>Isaan hunda walitti qabii biyyoo keessatti awwaali;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:13">fuula isaaniis awwaala keessa dhoksi.<verse eid="JOB 40:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14"/>Yoos ani mataan koo, akka harki kee mirgaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:14">si oolchuu dandaʼu siifin mirkaneessa.<verse eid="JOB 40:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15"/>“Bihemootin ani akkuman si uumettin uume,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:15">kan akkuma qotiyyoo marga dheedu sana mee ilaali.<verse eid="JOB 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16"/>Jabinni isaa dugda isaa keessa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:16">humni isaa immoo ribuu garaa isaa keessa jira!<verse eid="JOB 40:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17"/>Eegeen isaa akkuma muka birbirsaa raafama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:17">ribuun tafa isaa wal keessa xaxamaa dha.<verse eid="JOB 40:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18"/>Lafeen isaa akka ujummoo naasii ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:18">harkii fi miilli isaa immoo akka ulee sibiilaa ti.<verse eid="JOB 40:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19"/>Inni uumamawwan Waaqaa keessaa hangafa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:19">garuu inni isa uume goraadee isaatiin isatti dhiʼaachuu dandaʼa.<verse eid="JOB 40:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20"/>Gaarran marga ni kennuuf;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:20">bineensonni hundi naannoo isaa ni burraaqu.<verse eid="JOB 40:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21"/>Inni huuxxii qoraattii qabu jala ciisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:21">shambaqqoo lafa dhaqdhaqii keessa dhokata.<verse eid="JOB 40:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22"/>Gaaddisni huuxxii qoraattii qabuu isa haguuga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:22">alaltuun lagaas isa marsa.<verse eid="JOB 40:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23"/>Yommuu lagni cabsee yaaʼutti iyyuu kunoo, inni hin rifatu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:23">Lagni Yordaanos afaan isaa irra garagalu iyyuu inni hin shishu.<verse eid="JOB 40:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24"/>Namni utuma inni arguu isa qabuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:24">yookaan kiyyoodhaan isa qabee funyaan isaa uruu dandaʼu tokko iyyuu jiraa?<verse eid="JOB 40:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1"/>“Ati hokkoo qurxummiitiin Lewaataan harkiftee baasuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:1">yookaan arraba isaa funyoodhaan hidhuu ni dandeessaa?<verse eid="JOB 41:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2"/>Funyaan isaa keessa funyoo baasuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:2">yookaan lafee mangaagaa isaa hokkoodhaan uruu ni dandeessaa?<verse eid="JOB 41:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3"/>Inni akka ati isaaf araaramtuuf guddisee si kadhataa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:3">Afaan nagaatiinis sitti ni dubbataa?<verse eid="JOB 41:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4"/>Akka ati bara baraan garbicha godhattuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:4">inni si wajjin kakuu ni galaa?<verse eid="JOB 41:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5"/>Ati akka simbirroota wajjin taphattu isa wajjin ni taphattaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:5">Yookaan shamarran keetiif isa ni hiitaa?<verse eid="JOB 41:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6"/>Daldaltoonni isa irratti gatii wal dubbatuu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:6">Warra bitee gurguruufis isa ni qooduu?<verse eid="JOB 41:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7"/>Ati gogaa isaa xiyyaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:7">yookaan mataa isaa hokkoo ittiin qurxummii qabaniin <optbreak/> wawwaraanuu ni dandeessaa?<verse eid="JOB 41:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8"/>Yoo harka keetiin isa tuqxe, walʼaansoo sana ni yaadatta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:8">deebitees waan sana hin gootu!<verse eid="JOB 41:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9"/>Isa moʼanna jedhanii abdachuun soba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:9">ijumaan isa ilaaluunuu nama hollachiisa.<verse eid="JOB 41:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10"/>Namni isa dammaqsuuf garaa qabaatu tokko iyyuu hin jiru.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:10">Egaa namni na dura dhaabachuu dandaʼu eenyu?<verse eid="JOB 41:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11"/>Namni waa natti kennatee ani deebisuufii qabu eenyu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:11">Wanni samii jala jiru hundinuu kanuma koo ti.<verse eid="JOB 41:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12"/>“Ani waaʼee harkaa fi miilla isaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:12">waaʼee jabinaa fi dhaaba toluu isaa dubbachuu hin dhiisu.<verse eid="JOB 41:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13"/>Eenyutu uffata inni irraan uffatu irraa baasa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:13">Eenyutu luugama qabatee isatti dhiʼaata?<verse eid="JOB 41:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14"/>Eenyutu balbala afaan isaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:14">isa ilkaan isaa sodaachisaa sanaan marfame banuu dandaʼa?<verse eid="JOB 41:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15"/>Dugdi isaa gaachanawwan tarree galan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:15">kanneen akka malee walitti maxxanfaman qaba;<verse eid="JOB 41:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16"/>tokkoon tokkoon gaachanawwan sanaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:16">akka qilleensi gidduu isaanii hin baaneef baayʼee walitti maxxanu.<verse eid="JOB 41:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17"/>Isaan jabeeffamanii walitti qabsiifaman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:17">waan walitti fayyaniif gargar hin baafaman.<verse eid="JOB 41:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18"/>Haxxissoon isaa balaqqeessa ifaa baasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:18">iji isaa immoo akkuma ifa biiftuu reefuu baatuu ti.<verse eid="JOB 41:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19"/>Afaan isaa keessaa arraba ibiddaatu baʼa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:19">qaanqeenis afaan isaa keessaa ni faffacaʼa.<verse eid="JOB 41:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20"/>Akkuma aara xuwwee ibidda shambaqqoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:20">irratti dafqu keessaa baʼuu funyaan isaatii aarri ni baʼa.<verse eid="JOB 41:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21"/>Hafuurri afaan isaatii baʼu cilee ibiddaa qabsiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:21">afaan isaa keessaas arrabni ibiddaa ni baʼa.<verse eid="JOB 41:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22"/>Morma isaa keessa jabinatu jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:22">sodaachisuunis fuula isaa dura ni utaala.<verse eid="JOB 41:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23"/>Dachaan foon isaa wal qabateera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:23">dachaan sunis walitti fayyeera; hin sochoʼus.<verse eid="JOB 41:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24"/>Lapheen isaa akka kattaa jabaata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:24">akka dhagaa daakuus jabaa dha.<verse eid="JOB 41:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25"/>Yeroo inni ol kaʼutti, jajjaboonni ni sodaatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:25">yommuu inni lafa sochoosaa dhufutti isaan of irra garagalanii baqatu.<verse eid="JOB 41:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26"/>Goraadeen itti buʼu illee homaa isa hin godhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:26">eeboon yookaan xiyyi yookaan ankaaseenis homaa isa hin godhu.<verse eid="JOB 41:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 41:27"/>Inni sibiila akka cidiitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:27">naasii immoo akka muka tortoreetti heda.<verse eid="JOB 41:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 41:28"/>Xiyyi isa hin baqachiisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:28">dhagaan furrisaa isaaf akkuma habaqii ti.<verse eid="JOB 41:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 41:29"/>Bokkuun isaaf akkuma cidii ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:29">inni mirmirfamuu eebootti ni kolfa.<verse eid="JOB 41:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 41:30"/>Garaan isaa jalli akka cabaa okkotee kan qara qabuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:30">akka muka ittiin midhaan dhaʼaniittis dhoqqee baqaqsa.<verse eid="JOB 41:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 41:31"/>Inni tuujuba akka okkotee dafquutti koqsiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:31">galaanas akkuma bilqaaxxii dibataa raasa.<verse eid="JOB 41:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 41:32"/>Inni duuba isaatiin akka karaan ifu ni godha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:32">namni waan tuujubni sun rifeensa adii qabu seʼa.<verse eid="JOB 41:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 41:33"/>Uumamni homaa hin sodaanne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:33">kan isaan qixxaatu tokko iyyuu lafa irra hin jiru.<verse eid="JOB 41:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 41:34"/>Inni warra of tuulu ni tuffata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:34">warra of jaju hunda irratti mootii dha.”<verse eid="JOB 41:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyyoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1"/>Iyyoobis akkana jedhee <char style="nd">Waaqayyoof</char> deebii kenne:<verse eid="JOB 42:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2"/>“Ani akka ati waan hunda hojjechuu dandeessu nan beeka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:2">karoorri kee tokko iyyuu karaatti hin hafu.<verse eid="JOB 42:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3"/>Ati, ‘Namni beekumsa malee gorsa koo dhoksu kun eenyu?’ jettee gaafatte.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">Ani dhugumaan waan naaf hin galin, waan dinqii natti taʼe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">kan ani hin beekin dubbadheera.<verse eid="JOB 42:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4"/>“Ati akkana jetteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:4">‘Ani nan dubbadhaa mee dhaggeeffadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:4">ani sin gaafadhaa, ati immoo naaf deebisi.’<verse eid="JOB 42:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5"/>Gurri koo waaʼee kee dhagaʼee ture;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:5">amma garuu iji koo si argeera.<verse eid="JOB 42:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6"/>Kanaafuu ani of tuffadhee biyyoo fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:6">daaraa keessa taaʼee qalbii nan jijjiirradha.”<verse eid="JOB 42:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xumura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7"/>
    <char style="nd">Waaqayyo</char> erga waan kana Iyyoobitti dubbatee booddee Eliifaaz Teemaanichaan akkana jedhe; “Sababii isin akka Iyyoob garbichi koo dubbate sana waaʼee koo waan qajeelaa hin dubbatiniif dheekkamsi koo siʼii fi michoota kee lamaanitti bobaʼeera. <verse eid="JOB 42:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8"/>Kanaafuu isin amma jiboota torbaa fi korbeeyyii hoolaa torba fuudhaatii gara garbicha koo Iyyoob dhaqaatii waaʼee ofii keessaniitiif aarsaa gubamu dhiʼeessaa. Iyyoob garbichi koo isinii kadhata; ani kadhannaa isaa nan dhagaʼa; akka balleessaa keessaniittis isinitti hin muru. Isin akka Iyyoob garbichi koo dubbate sana waaʼee koo waan qajeelaa hin dubbanneetii.” <verse eid="JOB 42:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9"/>Kanaafuu Eliifaaz Teemaanichi, Bildaad Shuhaahichii fi Zoofaari Naaʼimaatichi waan <char style="nd">Waaqayyo</char> isaanitti hime sana godhan; <char style="nd">Waaqayyos</char> kadhannaa Iyyoob dhagaʼe.<verse eid="JOB 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10"/>Erga Iyyoob michoota isaatiif kadhatee booddee <char style="nd">Waaqayyo</char> deebisee isa sooromsee qabeenya inni duraan qabu sana harka lama kenneef. <verse eid="JOB 42:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11"/>Obboloonni isaa, obboleettonni isaa hundinuu fi warri dur isa beekan hundi dhufanii mana isaatti isa wajjin nyaatan. Isaanis sababii rakkina <char style="nd">Waaqayyo</char> isatti fide hundaatiif isaaf gaddanii isa jajjabeessan; tokkoon tokkoon isaaniis meetii fi qubeelaa warqee kennaniif.<verse eid="JOB 42:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12"/>
    <char style="nd">Waaqayyos</char> kan duraa caalaa jireenya Iyyoob kan fuul duraa eebbise. Iyyoobis hoolaa kuma kudha afur, gaala kuma jaʼa, qotiyyoo kuma lamaa fi harree dhaltuu kuma tokko qaba ture. <verse eid="JOB 42:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13"/>Akkasumas ilmaan torbaa fi intallan sadii qaba ture. <verse eid="JOB 42:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14"/>Intala isaa jalqabaa Yemiimaa, ishee lammaffaa Keziiyaa, ishee sadaffaa immoo Qeren-Haphuuk jedhee moggaase. <verse eid="JOB 42:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15"/>Biyya sana hunda keessatti dubartoonni akka intallan Iyyoob babbareedan eessattuu hin argamne. Abbaan isaaniis obboloota isaanii gidduutti dhaala kenneef.<verse eid="JOB 42:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16"/>Iyyoobis ergasii waggaa dhibba tokkoo fi afurtama jiraate; innis hamma dhaloota afuriitti ijoollee fi ijoollee ijoollee isaa arge. <verse eid="JOB 42:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17"/>Innis akkasiin bara dheeraa jiraatee dulloomee duʼe.<verse eid="JOB 42:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42"/>
</usx>
